e | [Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [conventional-changelog](https://conventional-changelog.js.org/conventional-changelog/) ([source](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/conventional-changelog/tree/HEAD/packages/conventional-changelog)) | [`^7.2.0` → `^8.0.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/conventional-changelog/7.2.1/8.0.0) | ![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/conventional-changelog/8.0.0?slim=true) | ![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/conventional-changelog/7.2.1/8.0.0?slim=true) |\n\n---\n\n> ⚠️ **Warning**\n> \n> Some dependencies could not be looked up. Check the Dependency Dashboard for more information.\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>conventional-changelog/conventional-changelog (conventional-changelog)</summary>\n\n### [`v8.0.0`](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/conventional-changelog/blob/HEAD/packages/conventional-changelog/CHANGELOG.md!800-2026-06-26)\n\n[Compare Source](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/conventional-changelog/compare/conventional-changelog-v7.2.1...conventional-changelog-v8.0.0)\n\n##### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n- Handlebars template strings and partial files were replaced with render functions.\n- packages now require Node.js 22 or newer.\n\n##### Features\n\n- replace handlebars templates with render functions ([#&!8203;1477](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/conventional-changelog/issues/1477)) ([55e6716](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/conventional-changelog/commit/55e6716e8f40c2a705bcb0cd343e1dcacd2f9459))\n- require node 22 ([de5e136](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/conventional-changelog/commit/de5e1368096ea0805e51e20df587ce528ca0575b))\n- support manual commit ranges ([#&!8203;1486](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/conventional-changelog/issues/1486)) ([45e1a20](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/conventional-changelog/commit/45e1a20110226e7aebaea8dd3cec7ef5e3eaf4db))\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n- use lightweight package data normalization ([#&!8203;1481](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/conventional-changelog/issues/1481)) ([b2564d1](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/conventional-changelog/commit/b2564d1f08e839837debe1f840b07a939851ff69))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or PR is renamed to start with \"rebase!\".\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won''t be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Mend Renovate](https://github.com/renovatebot/renovate).\n\n\n\nRelated work items: #379429, #381787","tree":{"sha":"00ef98dc07e5010890bc558e1f2ef14b843db165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helsenorge/core-frontend-packages/git/trees/00ef98dc07e5010890bc558e1f2ef14b843db165"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helsenorge/core-frontend-packages/git/commits/ae2628a99a6bb0a7b7e3974b4fa981962fc54fe1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161304732?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/audunrunhn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/audunrunhn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/audunrunhn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/audunrunhn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/audunrunhn","id":161304732,"login":"audunrunhn","node_id":"U_kgDOCZ1QnA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/audunrunhn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/audunrunhn/