##### Fixed\n\n- Fix inconsistent paths in cobertura reports [#&!8203;1723](https://github.com/coverlet-coverage/coverlet/issues/1723)\n- Fix when using \"is\" with \"and\" in pattern matching, branch coverage is lower than normal [#&!8203;1313](https://github.com/coverlet-coverage/coverlet/issues/1313)\n- Fix Coverlet flagging a branch for an async functions finally block where none exists [#&!8203;1337](https://github.com/coverlet-coverage/coverlet/issues/1337)\n- Fix Coverlet Tracker Missing CompilerGeneratedAttribute [#&!8203;1828](https://github.com/coverlet-coverage/coverlet/issues/1828)\n\n##### Maintenance\n\n- Add architecture docs and diagrams for all integrations [#&!8203;1927](https://github.com/coverlet-coverage/coverlet/pull/1927)\n- Update NuGet packages and .NET SDK versions [#&!8203;1933](https://github.com/coverlet-coverage/coverlet/pull/1933)\n\n[Diff between 10.0.0 and 10.0.1](https://github.com/coverlet-coverage/coverlet/compare/v10.0.0...v10.0.1)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or PR is renamed to start with \"rebase!\".\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won''t be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Mend Renovate](https://github.com/renovatebot/renovate).\n\n\n\nRelated work items: #342062, #379429","tree":{"sha":"9b2bb98b79c43268173ba0c7263564a564495d10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helsenorge/core-frontend-packages/git/trees/9b2bb98b79c43268173ba0c7263564a564495d10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helsenorge/core-frontend-packages/git/commits/db2e27f591672753c73bf7b8accfc94a7f1ebf50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"av