0ea2451688e6a40ce2c75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commits/20b3c6c08a0958855080ea2451688e6a40ce2c75"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96288645?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks","id":96288645,"login":"vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks","node_id":"U_kgDOBb0_hQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commits/fd214ad482d2ef2d87d865774b75bad9d74a4bdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:38:02Z","email":"96288645+vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks@users.noreply.github.com","name":"vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:38:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"BAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI (#289)\n\n* BAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI\n\nAdds .github/workflows/trufflehog.yml. Runs TruffleHog OSS on pull\nrequests, pushes to the default branch, and weekly over full history.\n\nOnly credentials verified live against the provider''s API fail the job\n(--results=verified), so vendored test fixtures and .env placeholders are\nignored. Both actions are pinned to commit SHAs and the workflow requests\nonly contents: read.\n\n* BAH-5025 | Drop the weekly cron from the TruffleHog workflow\n\nGitHub disables a scheduled workflow in a public repo after 60 days with no\nrepository activity, and the disable applies to the whole workflow, not just\nthe cron trigger. Bahmni/bahmni-api-test-automation and\nBahmni/openmrs-module-bedmanagement had already lost Semgrep on every PR this\nway, and GitHub does not re-enable it when the repo becomes active again.\n\nScanning on pull_request and on push to the default branch is unchanged, and\nworkflow_dispatch stays for an on-demand full scan.","tree":{"sha":"e21c04e4115703cc71fbb9babba17ade630bafe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/git/trees/e21c04e4115703cc71fbb9babba17ade630bafe1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/git/commits/fd214ad482d2ef2d87d865774b75bad9d74a4bdf","verification":{"payload":"tree e21c04e4115703cc71fbb9babba17ade630bafe1\nparent 20527ff58a63c43006e3a052f7a7be63f673cbbb\nauthor vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks <96288645+vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks@users.noreply.github.com> 1791351482 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791351482 +0530\n\nBAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI (#289)\n\n* BAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI\n\nAdds .github/workflows/trufflehog.yml. Runs TruffleHog OSS on pull\nrequests, pushes to the default branch, and weekly over full history.\n\nOnly credentials verified live against the provider''s API fail the job\n(--results=verified), so vendored test fixtures and .env placeholders are\nignored. Both actions are pinned to commit SHAs and the workflow requests\nonly contents: read.\n\n* BAH-5025 | Drop the weekly cron from the TruffleHog workflow\n\nGitHub disables a scheduled workflow in a public repo after 60 days with no\nrepository activity, and the disable applies to the whole workflow, not just\nthe cron trigger. Bahmni/bahmni-api-test-automation and\nBahmni/openmrs-module-bedmanagement had already lost Semgrep on every PR this\nway, and GitHub does not re-enable it when the repo becomes active again.\n\nScanning on pull_request and on push to the default branch is unchanged, and\nworkflow_dispatch stays for an on-demand full scan.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxdq6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACbEQAEwuk6kITNEl6cAxSre8Wfp1\n8YnMDWW4znDbzfluGB4k/MqGcxR9Xkvu8JeMfy9PNX6CjUmhf3CM4N4lY9VS/Tli\nKCnvdCR1HTNhReDchquOcHD84qIhYV6oLqlJjusaW3e6YGE/+kWq1c2iM7bTI6Iu\nG8irwIBJyoAY1JTXuyJndIXLN9+xTE/mpihGkhkqBUBPPmy4EtoF2N1i5Uis8x3S\nbo1/b+a6ip4c0/OEhCKsjL+AlG7M22uoRCezpb95LjxpMOsDJ12WpOvuEOiL7dft\n3EFgZdsoJOS6dhGSjPMGmSkXTNideR1u31ocq7TV+SVUeomMsiC4Zf4oKakOCr5Y\n3TtN6DvL4uInTyhBsKc9XvfIVxDeq35LesNgNk2hfoGZ7l/YBdyBsyvMQaPATQbi\nywRE9998sJkANjdAgbVTazMiIBR0CeVgJCsDnXdNA5Asi8XNJZJ7iqK6wpdTYNyf\nsdejiMR5dxBDTGXETiVZIurvrWOLZ/8ikybeOsTjFM/zD5zz0Y1TmY4+xY7DBk4O\nAW+maEW/dzRha7BzbZusfFb83BsWescvSZyNm8Tq0yovWJ6Brs3mC5ypyT7ybTke\n1Rq3uGG2txJhPE4F3Q1xBQcRjv8dzZVDh0qkQUkveFHuLTDqKRA9r4ChsabhzZ1/\nHMQ2DlfehCv5u/MGgUxs\n=GMb0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T05:38:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commit/fd214ad482d2ef2d87d865774b75bad9d74a4bdf","node_id":"C_kwDOJx4N2NoAKGZkMjE0YWQ0ODJkMmVmMmQ4N2Q4NjU3NzRiNzViYWQ5ZDc0YTRiZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commit/20527ff58a63c43006e3a052f7a7be63f673cbbb","sha":"20527ff58a63c43006e3a052f7a7be63f673cbbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commits/20527ff58a63c43006e3a052f7a7be63f673cbbb"}],"sha":"fd214ad482d2ef2d87d865774b75bad9d74a4bdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commits/fd214ad482d2ef2d87d865774b75bad9d74a4bdf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239930247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingeswaranTW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingeswaranTW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingeswaranTW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingeswaranTW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lingeswaranTW","id":239930247,"login":"lingeswaranTW","node_id":"U_kgDODk0Lhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingeswaranTW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingeswaranTW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingeswaranTW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingeswaranTW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingeswaranTW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingeswaranTW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commits/20527ff58a63c43006e3a052f7a7be63f673cbbb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T05:03:20Z","email":"lingeswaran.s@thoughtworks.com","name":"Lingeswaran Subramaniyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T05:03:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"BAH-4874 Draft Forms (#281)\n\n* BAH-4874 Initial changes\n\n* Apply correct styles to the draft indicator (#51)\n\n* Implement Draft overlay backend integration (#56)\n\n* Auto refresh the draft overlay contents (#66)\n\n* Remove the encounter attribute usage as not needed for Form Draft feature\n\n* Hive-123854 | Banti | Draft indicator should be accessible as per toggle (#108)\n\n* Banti | Draft indicator should be accessible as per toggle\n\n* Fix form draft overlay accessible even toggle is off issue\n\n(cherry picked from commit d24f33a212e0fbb12149235adc517312b27b59b2)\n\n* BAH-4874 | Handle draft fetch failure with error state and fix withCredentials\n\n- Add withCredentials: true to fetchDraftsForProvider axios call for cross-origin auth\n- Track fetchError state in DraftIndicator to distinguish fetch failure from empty drafts\n- Show error message in DraftOverlay when fetch fails instead of misleading empty state\n- Add PropTypes for providerUuid in DraftIndicator\n- Add node env to eslint test overrides to allow require/global in spec files\n- Add tests covering fetch failure scenario\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* BAH-4874 | PR review changes | Resolve provider from authenticated session instead of providerUuid for form drafts\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: sasikiran-tw <sasikiran.jakkula@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Soorya <sooryakumaran.c@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: bantirathod87 <banti.rathod@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pooja Sastry <pooja.sastry@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e16e00be7b0cf536d1b6681f8d7d6ec9bfe03a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/git/trees/6e16e00be7b0cf536d1b6681f8d7d6ec9bfe03a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/git/commits/20527ff58a63c43006e3a052f7a7be63f673cbbb","verification":{"payload":"tree 6e16e00be7b0cf536d1b6681f8d7d6ec9bfe03a3\nparent 6afeda361e3e321e7dd3d764016d1d5941ce7c6c\nauthor Lingeswaran Subramaniyam <lingeswaran.s@thoughtworks.com> 1790053400 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790053400 +0530\n\nBAH-4874 Draft Forms (#281)\n\n* BAH-4874 Initial changes\n\n* Apply correct styles to the draft indicator (#51)\n\n* Implement Draft overlay backend integration (#56)\n\n* Auto refresh the draft overlay contents (#66)\n\n* Remove the encounter attribute usage as not needed for Form Draft feature\n\n* Hive-123854 | Banti | Draft indicator should be accessible as per toggle (#108)\n\n* Banti | Draft indicator should be accessible as per toggle\n\n* Fix form draft overlay accessible even toggle is off issue\n\n(cherry picked from commit d24f33a212e0fbb12149235adc517312b27b59b2)\n\n* BAH-4874 | Handle draft fetch failure with error state and fix withCredentials\n\n- Add withCredentials: true to fetchDraftsForProvider axios call for cross-origin auth\n- Track fetchError state in DraftIndicator to distinguish fetch failure from empty drafts\n- Show error message in DraftOverlay when fetch fails instead of misleading empty state\n- Add PropTypes for providerUuid in DraftIndicator\n- Add node env to eslint test overrides to allow require/global in spec files\n- Add tests covering fetch failure scenario\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* BAH-4874 | PR review changes | Resolve provider from authenticated session instead of providerUuid for form drafts\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: sasikiran-tw <sasikiran.jakkula@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Soorya <sooryakumaran.