:"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commit/20527ff58a63c43006e3a052f7a7be63f673cbbb","node_id":"C_kwDOJx4N2NoAKDIwNTI3ZmY1OGE2M2M0MzAwNmUzYTA1MmY3YTdiZTYzZjY3M2NiYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commit/6afeda361e3e321e7dd3d764016d1d5941ce7c6c","sha":"6afeda361e3e321e7dd3d764016d1d5941ce7c6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commits/6afeda361e3e321e7dd3d764016d1d5941ce7c6c"}],"sha":"20527ff58a63c43006e3a052f7a7be63f673cbbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commits/20527ff58a63c43006e3a052f7a7be63f673cbbb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32308441?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vvkpd","id":32308441,"login":"vvkpd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzA4NDQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvkpd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commits/6afeda361e3e321e7dd3d764016d1d5941ce7c6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:49:48Z","email":"32308441+vvkpd@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vivek Pandey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:49:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"BAH-4917 | Add. Nurse Acknowledgement of Physician Instructions (#285)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-104257: Display pending and new tasks in IPD Care view\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-104257: Add locale for all, new and pending (#30)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-104257: fix: center align labels in care view task filter tab (#33)\n\n* Vivek/Banti: HIVE-108088: Add enableNurseAcknowledgement feature toggle to gate task filter view (#34)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-108160: fix: resolve more label overlapping time in nursing task (#36)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-108160: fix: resolve more label overlapping time in nursing task tile\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-108160: added claude.md\n\n* 104256: Add CareInstructions display control to IPD dashboard (#39)\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Add CareInstructions display control to IPD dashboard\n\n* 104256: Replace custom tabs with Carbon Tabs component in CareInstructions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* 104256: Fix critical and minor review findings in CareInstructions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Handle coded obs values in CareInstructions display\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Fix code smells in CareInstructions\n\n* 104256: Add Care Instructions locale keys to ipd-frontend locale files\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* 104256: Deduplicate fetchEncounterObs and rename util file to .jsx\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Refactor care instructions to use observations API with visitUuid (#41)\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Refactor care instructions to use observations API with visitUuid\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Address code review and QA coverage findings\n\n- Fix axios array serialization via paramsSerializer (concept[]=X -> concept=X)\n- Add catch block in loadInstructions for unhandled errors\n- Stabilise formConcepts default with module-level constant to avoid infinite re-render\n- Memoize allConceptNames outside useEffect\n- Refactor mapObservationsToInstructions: single reduce pass, Map lookup, extractObsValue helper\n- Rename short variables to meaningful names (fc, acc, obs, v, e, a/b)\n- Add 7 missing/insufficient tests: loading skeleton, error path, same-form multi-encounter (AC#4), null value, null input, patientUuid absence, serializeParams unit tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-111064 | Fix Care Instructions display issues and empty state alignment (#42)\n\n* VIVEK: HIVE-105551: Display new care instructions count in IPD care view (#46)\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105551 | Display new care instructions count in IPD care view\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105551 | Fix i18n typo and propTypes validation\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105551 | Simplify fetchBatchObservations API and rename instruction fetch function\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | Add task from instructions table (#48)\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | Add task from instructions table\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | Incorporate code review and refresh CI display control post nusring task is created\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | added to Dashboard''s isSliderOpen initial state for careInstructionsTasks\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | fix: rename labels, fix Add Task wrapping and tab panel padding in Care Instructions\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | Add fr translation for ACKNOWLEDGE_CARE_INSTRUCTIONS\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: Acknowledged tab driven by tasks (ipd-frontend) (#57)\n\n* feat(111216): Acknowledged tab driven by tasks (Iteration 3)\n\nImplements the nurse-facing acknowledged tab on CareInstructions.\nAfter a task is created for an instruction, the row automatically\nmoves from Not Acknowledged to Acknowledged on the next render.\n\n- CareInstructionsUtils: add fetchTasksByVisit (GET /tasks?visitUuid)\n  and surface obs.uuid as observationUuid on each mapped instruction row\n- CareInstructions: fetch tasks on mount; build Set of acknowledged\n  observation UUIDs; partition Not Acknowledged / Acknowledged tabs;\n  shared renderInstructionRows renders same layout (including Add Task)\n  in both tabs; pass selectedObservationUuid to AddEmergencyTasks slider;\n  refreshDisplayControl re-mounts component after save so tasks re-fetch\n- AddEmergencyTasks: accept optional observationUuid prop; include it in\n  createNonMedicationTaskPayload when present (no-op when called standalone)\n- Tests: mock fetchTasksByVisit in beforeEach; add obs uuid to mock data;\n  3 new partitioning tests; AddEmergencyTasks snapshot updated;\n  test mocks refactored to named functions to satisfy ESLint display-name rule\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(111216): Acknowledged tab driven by tasks (Iteration 3)\n\nImplements the nurse-facing acknowledged tab on CareInstructions.\nAfter a task is created for an instruction, the row automatically\nmoves from Not Acknowledged to Acknowledged on the next render.\n\n- CareInstructionsUtils: add fetchTasksByVisit (GET /tasks?visitUuid)\n  and surface obs.uuid as observationUuid on each mapped instruction row\n- CareInstructions: fetch tasks on mount; build Set of acknowledged\n  observation UUIDs; partition Not Acknowledged / Acknowledged tabs;\n  shared renderInstructionRows renders same layout (including Add Task)\n  in both tabs; pass selectedObservationUuid to AddEmergencyTasks slider;\n  refreshDisplayControl re-mounts component after save so tasks re-fetch\n- AddEmergencyTasks: accept optional observationUuid prop; include it in\n  createNonMedicationTaskPayload when present (no-op when called standalone)\n- Tests: mock fetchTasksByVisit in beforeEach; add obs uuid to mock data;\n  3 new partitioning tests; AddEmergencyTasks snapshot updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(111216): update AddEmergencyTasks snapshot for observationUuid prop\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(111216): fetch tasks by observationUuids instead of visitUuid\n\nSwitches the acknowledged-tab task lookup from visiting all tasks for\na visit to querying only tasks whose focus matches the current instruction\nobservation UUIDs. More targeted — no unnecessary tasks fetched.\n\n- fetchTasksByVisit → fetchTasksByObservationUuids(observationUuids[])\n  calls GET /tasks?observationUuids=...&startTime=0&endTime=now\n- Tasks effect now depends on [instructions] so it runs after obs load\n  and passes only the UUIDs actually present in the instruction list\n- Test spies updated to the renamed export\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: pass visit start and end time to fetchTasksByObservationUuids\n\nScopes the task lookup to the current admission window instead of fetching\nfrom epoch 0. startTime comes from visitSummary.startDateTime and endTime\nfrom visitSummary.stopDateTime (falls back to Date.now() for active visits).\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: fix visitSummary null guard and stale dep in tasks useEffect\n\nBlocker 1: add !visitSummary guard so startDateTime access never NPEs\nwhen visitSummary is null (e.g. before context loads).\nBlocker 2: add visitSummary to useEffect dep array so the effect re-runs\nwhen the visit ends mid-session and stopDateTime is populated.\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: switch acknowledged tab lookup to FHIR R4 Task?focus endpoint\n\nReplaces custom extension REST call with standard FHIR R4 search.\nGET /fhir2/r4/Task?focus=Observation/<uuid> returns a Bundle; each\nentry''s resource.focus.reference encodes the observation UUID as\n''Observation/<uuid>'' which is split to extract the UUID for the\nacknowledged Set.\n\n- constants.js: add FHIR_TASK_URL constant\n- CareInstructionsUtils: fetchTasksByObservationUuids now calls FHIR R4\n  endpoint; logs request URL and parsed response for debugging\n- CareInstructions: drop visitSummary/time-bound params (focus filter\n  is precise enough); simplify useEffect dep array back to [instructions]\n- Tests: remove mockVisitSummary, no other changes needed\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: fix FHIR focus search to use OR semantics via comma-separated values\n\nMultiple focus=Observation/uuid params joined with & created AND semantics\nin HAPI FHIR - requiring one task to match ALL observation UUIDs simultaneously\nwhich is always zero results. Comma-separated focus values create OR semantics:\nGET /fhir2/R4/Task?focus=Observation/uuid1,Observation/uuid2\n\nAlso use .pop() to safely extract UUID from focus.reference regardless\nof whether the reference is bare UUID or prefixed with ''Observation/''.\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: send generic focus reference in POST task payload\n\nReplace observationUuid with focus: { type, reference } to align with\nthe generalised TaskRequest contract in fhir2Extension. Caller now\nspecifies the resource type explicitly rather than hardcoding Observation.\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: address self-review findings in ipd-frontend\n\n     covering the save success path end-to-end\n     useMemo([instructions, acknowledgedObsUuids]) to avoid redundant\n     filtering on unrelated re-renders (slider open/close, etc.)\n\nNote: #4 (console.error on FHIR fetch failure) was already in place.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Care view shows only unacknowledged care instruction count (#62)\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Care view shows only unacknowledged care instruction count\n\nUse fetchTasksByObservationUuids to identify acknowledged care instructions\nand filter them out before displaying the count in the care view summary,\nmatching the acknowledged/not-acknowledged tab split in the detail view.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Address PR review comments\n\n- Extract fetchAcknowledgedObsUuids helper to CareInstructionsUtils to\n  eliminate duplicate Set-construction logic across detail and summary views\n- Add &_count=500 to FHIR Task URL to prevent silent pagination truncation\n  on busy wards; document why no status filter is applied\n- Guard task lookup with enableNurseAcknowledgement flag to avoid\n  unnecessary FHIR calls when the feature is disabled\n- Deduplicate allObsUuids before the API call\n- Rename careInstructions prop to unacknowledgedCareInstructions in\n  PatientDetailsCell to reflect the filtered semantics\n- Add multi-patient isolation test, enableNurseAcknowledgement=false\n  guard test, and failure-fallback test to CareViewPatientsSummary spec\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Replace chained array methods with single reduce for allObsUuids\n\nEliminates 5 intermediate array allocations by building the deduplicated\nSet in one pass using reduce instead of flat/map/filter/Set/spread.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Replace single-letter and abbreviated variable names\n\ns → section, fc → formConcept, p → patient, acc → obsUuidSet,\ni → instruction, e → entry, t → task for improved readability.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Rename fetchAcknowledgedObsUuids to fetchAcknowledgedObservationUuids\n\nSpells out the abbreviation ''Obs'' for consistency with the existing\nfetchTasksByObservationUuids naming convention in the same file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Avni|Hive-114116| Added changed for higlighing edited instrutions (#76)\n\n* Avni|Hive-114116| Added changed for higlighing edited instrutions\n\n* Avni|Hive-114116| Added loader to acknowledged care instructions\n\n* HIVE-113267: Pass orderUuid as basedOn in task creation from care instructions (#77)\n\n* HIVE-113267: Vivek: Pass orderUuid as basedOn in task creation from care instructions\n\n- fetchCareInstructionsObs: add filterObsWithOrders=false so ordered obs are visible in care instructions\n- fetchBatchObservations: add filterObsWithOrders=false in batch request\n- mapObservationsToInstructions: include orderUuid from obs response in mapped instruction\n- CareInstructions: combine observationUuid and orderUuid into single selectedInstruction state\n- AddEmergencyTasks: accept orderUuid prop; include basedOn ServiceRequest reference in task creation payload\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-113267: Vivek: Fix basedOn null guard and fetchBatchObservations parameter\n\n- Guard basedOn with spread operator to match focus pattern — prevents invalid FHIR\n  when orderUuid is null (obs not linked to any order)\n- Make filterObsWithOrders a parameter on fetchBatchObservations (default: false)\n  so CareViewPatientsSummary can control its own behaviour explicitly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-113267: Send FHIR-formatted reference for focus in non-medication task payload (#80)\n\n* HIVE-113267: Vivek: send FHIR-formatted reference for focus in non-medication task payload\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Security: fix ws CVE-2026-48779 and suppress form-data CVE-2026-12143\n\n- Bump ws resolution from ^5.2.4 to ^5.2.5 to fix memory exhaustion DoS (CVE-2026-48779)\n- Add CVE-2026-12143 to .trivyignore (form-data transitive dep, no direct multipart usage)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hive-121629 | Nandini | Add previous shift care instructions indicator (#97)\n\n* Nandini | Hive-121629 |  show previous shift indicator for new care instructions\n\n* Filter care instructions based on current shift start time\n* Track previous shift instructions separately\n* Display previous shift instruction count in patient summary\n* Change notification text to \"(Includes X from Previous Shift)\"\n* Highlight previous shift notification in red italics\n\n* Hive 121634| Avni | Ability to add more tasks for single day (#100)\n\n* Add bulk task creation with Add More functionality\n\n* Hive-121634| Added styling fixes\n\n* Hive-121634| Added changes for generic tab and css spacing\n\n* Hive-121634| Added text wrap of instruction\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| pr comments\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| pr comments for, removeing dead code, harcoding values and moving css to scss file\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| Added toggle config conditions and replace task-{} with crypto random uuid\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| Restored savenonmedicationtasks for single task\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| Updated failing tests\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| Resolved pr comment for task row uniqness using crypto random\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Stop pending tasks for a particular instruction (#104)\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Stop pending tasks for a particular instruction\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Updates based on PR review comments\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Updates based on PR Review comments, remove console logs\n\n* Hive-123554| Avni | Ability to add tasks for future dates (#106)\n\n* HIVE-123554 | Add future date scheduling for non-medication tasks\n\n* Hive-123554|Avni|Added cofig related changes for max future days\n\n* Avni | HIVE-123554| Added calender date in nursing tasks, shifted add task button for generic tasks\n\n* Avni | HIVE-123554| Fixed failing tests\n\n* pr comments\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| Resolved infinite loop issue\n\n* pr comments\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| Added css changes for calender and date and creator name\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| Added test cases to cover enabledate both scenarios\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| Refactor fromatted key and translatiosn to have more task(s)\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| pr comments for date and css reafctoring\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| refactor the max future date to have 60\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Code optimization for stop pending tasks (#109)\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Addressed PR comments to optimize code\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Removing unwanted comments\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Update tests for coverage\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Refactored to remove refetch tasks and setNotificationDirectMessage usage, made some enhancements\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Undo translation formatting\n\n* Pooja | Bug-124991 | Unresponsive Save Button in Task Panel (#110)\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Feature toggle and translation fix (#113)\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Modify default message usage for translation\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Fix for update success message not appearing after updating a Nursing task\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Add feature toggle for Stop tasks\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Fix for menu item not closing on clicking Stop Task\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Add tests for feature toggle\n\n* HIVE-121635: pooja | Vivek: Stop task refactoring (#115)\n\n* Refactor: replace getLocalizedLabel+getTranslationKey with FormattedMessage for static labels\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Refactor: replace getLocalizedLabel with FormattedMessage and remove helper\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Refactor: replace getLocalizedLabel with FormattedMessage and remove helper\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: rename Unstop to Un-Stop Task for consistency\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Clean up unnecessary code and add translations\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pooja Sastry <pooja.sastry@thoughtworks.com>\n\n* fix: resolve failing tests — add missing mocks, fix href race condition, update snapshots\n\n- Add missing mockSetShowSuccessNotification and mockSetSuccessMessage jest.fn() declarations in UpdateNursingTasks.spec.jsx (introduced but not defined in 8e2c853)\n- Initialize window.location.href with actual patientResponseData encounterUuid in PatientMovementModal.spec.jsx to avoid async race on href assertion\n- Update snapshots for Notification, PatientHeader, and UpdateNursingTasks test suites\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update encounter to Obs Datetime (#135)\n\n* Fix the translation issue for Care View Display control (#136)\n\n* fix: resolve failing tests — remove duplicate mock exports, add missing enableStopTasks, wire taskToFormMapping, update snapshots\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review comments — duplicate locale keys, UNKNOWN_ERROR display, and visitDetails guard\n\n- Remove duplicate IPD_STOP_TASK/IPD_UNSTOP_TASK keys from locale_en, locale_es, locale_fr; keep single canonical values\n- Update defaultMessage in UpdateNursingTasks.jsx from \"Un-Stop Task\" to \"Unstop Task\" to match locale; update tests to match\n- Use handleSetNotificationMessage(\"UNKNOWN_ERROR\") in CareInstructions.jsx so intl.formatMessage runs; add UNKNOWN_ERROR locale key to all three locale files\n- Add optional chaining on visitDetails?.uuid in CareViewPatientsSummary.jsx for style consistency\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: include care instructions in NEW tab filter predicate\n\nPatients with unacknowledged care instructions but no new medications\nwere visible in the ward (warning badge shown) yet hidden from the New\ntab — update the filter to also check careInstructionsMap so such\npatients appear correctly. Add a test covering this case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Avni Tanwar Tw <avni.tanwar@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Nandinidasari60 <dasari.nandini@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pooja Sastry <pooja.sastry@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Soorya Kumaran C <90232857+SooryaKumaranC-tw@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c5434c1dd29111b3d527e0faa3ffe179afcd7c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/git/trees/1c5434c1dd29111b3d527e0faa3ffe179afcd7c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/git/commits/6afeda361e3e321e7dd3d764016d1d5941ce7c6c","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c5434c1dd29111b3d527e0faa3ffe179afcd7c6\nparent b3f3ba60cc3fe39f064d3f85e137e48f1418f5f0\nauthor Vivek Pandey <32308441+vvkpd@users.noreply.github.com> 1789969788 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789969788 +0530\n\nBAH-4917 | Add. Nurse Acknowledgement of Physician Instructions (#285)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-104257: Display pending and new tasks in IPD Care view\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-104257: Add locale for all, new and pending (#30)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-104257: fix: center align labels in care view task filter tab (#33)\n\n* Vivek/Banti: HIVE-108088: Add enableNurseAcknowledgement feature toggle to gate task filter view (#34)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-108160: fix: resolve more label overlapping time in nursing task (#36)\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-108160: fix: resolve more label overlapping time in nursing task tile\n\n* Vivek: HIVE-108160: added claude.md\n\n* 104256: Add CareInstructions display control to IPD dashboard (#39)\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Add CareInstructions display control to IPD dashboard\n\n* 104256: Replace custom tabs with Carbon Tabs component in CareInstructions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* 104256: Fix critical and minor review findings in CareInstructions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Handle coded obs values in CareInstructions display\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Fix code smells in CareInstructions\n\n* 104256: Add Care Instructions locale keys to ipd-frontend locale files\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* 104256: Deduplicate fetchEncounterObs and rename util file to .jsx\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Refactor care instructions to use observations API with visitUuid (#41)\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Refactor care instructions to use observations API with visitUuid\n\n* Vivek | Hive-104256 | Address code review and QA coverage findings\n\n- Fix axios array serialization via paramsSerializer (concept[]=X -> concept=X)\n- Add catch block in loadInstructions for unhandled errors\n- Stabilise formConcepts default with module-level constant to avoid infinite re-render\n- Memoize allConceptNames outside useEffect\n- Refactor mapObservationsToInstructions: single reduce pass, Map lookup, extractObsValue helper\n- Rename short variables to meaningful names (fc, acc, obs, v, e, a/b)\n- Add 7 missing/insufficient tests: loading skeleton, error path, same-form multi-encounter (AC#4), null value, null input, patientUuid absence, serializeParams unit tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-111064 | Fix Care Instructions display issues and empty state alignment (#42)\n\n* VIVEK: HIVE-105551: Display new care instructions count in IPD care view (#46)\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105551 | Display new care instructions count in IPD care view\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105551 | Fix i18n typo and propTypes validation\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105551 | Simplify fetchBatchObservations API and rename instruction fetch function\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | Add task from instructions table (#48)\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | Add task from instructions table\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | Incorporate code review and refresh CI display control post nusring task is created\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | added to Dashboard''s isSliderOpen initial state for careInstructionsTasks\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | fix: rename labels, fix Add Task wrapping and tab panel padding in Care Instructions\n\n* Vivek | HIVE-105549 | Add fr translation for ACKNOWLEDGE_CARE_INSTRUCTIONS\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: Acknowledged tab driven by tasks (ipd-frontend) (#57)\n\n* feat(111216): Acknowledged tab driven by tasks (Iteration 3)\n\nImplements the nurse-facing acknowledged tab on CareInstructions.\nAfter a task is created for an instruction, the row automatically\nmoves from Not Acknowledged to Acknowledged on the next render.\n\n- CareInstructionsUtils: add fetchTasksByVisit (GET /tasks?visitUuid)\n  and surface obs.uuid as observationUuid on each mapped instruction row\n- CareInstructions: fetch tasks on mount; build Set of acknowledged\n  observation UUIDs; partition Not Acknowledged / Acknowledged tabs;\n  shared renderInstructionRows renders same layout (including Add Task)\n  in both tabs; pass selectedObservationUuid to AddEmergencyTasks slider;\n  refreshDisplayControl re-mounts component after save so tasks re-fetch\n- AddEmergencyTasks: accept optional observationUuid prop; include it in\n  createNonMedicationTaskPayload when present (no-op when called standalone)\n- Tests: mock fetchTasksByVisit in beforeEach; add obs uuid to mock data;\n  3 new partitioning tests; AddEmergencyTasks snapshot updated;\n  test mocks refactored to named functions to satisfy ESLint display-name rule\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(111216): Acknowledged tab driven by tasks (Iteration 3)\n\nImplements the nurse-facing acknowledged tab on CareInstructions.\nAfter a task is created for an instruction, the row automatically\nmoves from Not Acknowledged to Acknowledged on the next render.\n\n- CareInstructionsUtils: add fetchTasksByVisit (GET /tasks?visitUuid)\n  and surface obs.uuid as observationUuid on each mapped instruction row\n- CareInstructions: fetch tasks on mount; build Set of acknowledged\n  observation UUIDs; partition Not Acknowledged / Acknowledged tabs;\n  shared renderInstructionRows renders same layout (including Add Task)\n  in both tabs; pass selectedObservationUuid to AddEmergencyTasks slider;\n  refreshDisplayControl re-mounts component after save so tasks re-fetch\n- AddEmergencyTasks: accept optional observationUuid prop; include it in\n  createNonMedicationTaskPayload when present (no-op when called standalone)\n- Tests: mock fetchTasksByVisit in beforeEach; add obs uuid to mock data;\n  3 new partitioning tests; AddEmergencyTasks snapshot updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(111216): update AddEmergencyTasks snapshot for observationUuid prop\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(111216): fetch tasks by observationUuids instead of visitUuid\n\nSwitches the acknowledged-tab task lookup from visiting all tasks for\na visit to querying only tasks whose focus matches the current instruction\nobservation UUIDs. More targeted — no unnecessary tasks fetched.\n\n- fetchTasksByVisit → fetchTasksByObservationUuids(observationUuids[])\n  calls GET /tasks?observationUuids=...&startTime=0&endTime=now\n- Tasks effect now depends on [instructions] so it runs after obs load\n  and passes only the UUIDs actually present in the instruction list\n- Test spies updated to the renamed export\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: pass visit start and end time to fetchTasksByObservationUuids\n\nScopes the task lookup to the current admission window instead of fetching\nfrom epoch 0. startTime comes from visitSummary.startDateTime and endTime\nfrom visitSummary.stopDateTime (falls back to Date.now() for active visits).\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: fix visitSummary null guard and stale dep in tasks useEffect\n\nBlocker 1: add !visitSummary guard so startDateTime access never NPEs\nwhen visitSummary is null (e.g. before context loads).\nBlocker 2: add visitSummary to useEffect dep array so the effect re-runs\nwhen the visit ends mid-session and stopDateTime is populated.\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: switch acknowledged tab lookup to FHIR R4 Task?focus endpoint\n\nReplaces custom extension REST call with standard FHIR R4 search.\nGET /fhir2/r4/Task?focus=Observation/<uuid> returns a Bundle; each\nentry''s resource.focus.reference encodes the observation UUID as\n''Observation/<uuid>'' which is split to extract the UUID for the\nacknowledged Set.\n\n- constants.js: add FHIR_TASK_URL constant\n- CareInstructionsUtils: fetchTasksByObservationUuids now calls FHIR R4\n  endpoint; logs request URL and parsed response for debugging\n- CareInstructions: drop visitSummary/time-bound params (focus filter\n  is precise enough); simplify useEffect dep array back to [instructions]\n- Tests: remove mockVisitSummary, no other changes needed\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: fix FHIR focus search to use OR semantics via comma-separated values\n\nMultiple focus=Observation/uuid params joined with & created AND semantics\nin HAPI FHIR - requiring one task to match ALL observation UUIDs simultaneously\nwhich is always zero results. Comma-separated focus values create OR semantics:\nGET /fhir2/R4/Task?focus=Observation/uuid1,Observation/uuid2\n\nAlso use .pop() to safely extract UUID from focus.reference regardless\nof whether the reference is bare UUID or prefixed with ''Observation/''.\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: send generic focus reference in POST task payload\n\nReplace observationUuid with focus: { type, reference } to align with\nthe generalised TaskRequest contract in fhir2Extension. Caller now\nspecifies the resource type explicitly rather than hardcoding Observation.\n\n* HIVE-111216: Vivek: address self-review findings in ipd-frontend\n\n     covering the save success path end-to-end\n     useMemo([instructions, acknowledgedObsUuids]) to avoid redundant\n     filtering on unrelated re-renders (slider open/close, etc.)\n\nNote: #4 (console.error on FHIR fetch failure) was already in place.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Care view shows only unacknowledged care instruction count (#62)\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Care view shows only unacknowledged care instruction count\n\nUse fetchTasksByObservationUuids to identify acknowledged care instructions\nand filter them out before displaying the count in the care view summary,\nmatching the acknowledged/not-acknowledged tab split in the detail view.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Address PR review comments\n\n- Extract fetchAcknowledgedObsUuids helper to CareInstructionsUtils to\n  eliminate duplicate Set-construction logic across detail and summary views\n- Add &_count=500 to FHIR Task URL to prevent silent pagination truncation\n  on busy wards; document why no status filter is applied\n- Guard task lookup with enableNurseAcknowledgement flag to avoid\n  unnecessary FHIR calls when the feature is disabled\n- Deduplicate allObsUuids before the API call\n- Rename careInstructions prop to unacknowledgedCareInstructions in\n  PatientDetailsCell to reflect the filtered semantics\n- Add multi-patient isolation test, enableNurseAcknowledgement=false\n  guard test, and failure-fallback test to CareViewPatientsSummary spec\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Replace chained array methods with single reduce for allObsUuids\n\nEliminates 5 intermediate array allocations by building the deduplicated\nSet in one pass using reduce instead of flat/map/filter/Set/spread.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Replace single-letter and abbreviated variable names\n\ns → section, fc → formConcept, p → patient, acc → obsUuidSet,\ni → instruction, e → entry, t → task for improved readability.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-116639: Vivek: Rename fetchAcknowledgedObsUuids to fetchAcknowledgedObservationUuids\n\nSpells out the abbreviation ''Obs'' for consistency with the existing\nfetchTasksByObservationUuids naming convention in the same file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Avni|Hive-114116| Added changed for higlighing edited instrutions (#76)\n\n* Avni|Hive-114116| Added changed for higlighing edited instrutions\n\n* Avni|Hive-114116| Added loader to acknowledged care instructions\n\n* HIVE-113267: Pass orderUuid as basedOn in task creation from care instructions (#77)\n\n* HIVE-113267: Vivek: Pass orderUuid as basedOn in task creation from care instructions\n\n- fetchCareInstructionsObs: add filterObsWithOrders=false so ordered obs are visible in care instructions\n- fetchBatchObservations: add filterObsWithOrders=false in batch request\n- mapObservationsToInstructions: include orderUuid from obs response in mapped instruction\n- CareInstructions: combine observationUuid and orderUuid into single selectedInstruction state\n- AddEmergencyTasks: accept orderUuid prop; include basedOn ServiceRequest reference in task creation payload\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-113267: Vivek: Fix basedOn null guard and fetchBatchObservations parameter\n\n- Guard basedOn with spread operator to match focus pattern — prevents invalid FHIR\n  when orderUuid is null (obs not linked to any order)\n- Make filterObsWithOrders a parameter on fetchBatchObservations (default: false)\n  so CareViewPatientsSummary can control its own behaviour explicitly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* HIVE-113267: Send FHIR-formatted reference for focus in non-medication task payload (#80)\n\n* HIVE-113267: Vivek: send FHIR-formatted reference for focus in non-medication task payload\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Security: fix ws CVE-2026-48779 and suppress form-data CVE-2026-12143\n\n- Bump ws resolution from ^5.2.4 to ^5.2.5 to fix memory exhaustion DoS (CVE-2026-48779)\n- Add CVE-2026-12143 to .trivyignore (form-data transitive dep, no direct multipart usage)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hive-121629 | Nandini | Add previous shift care instructions indicator (#97)\n\n* Nandini | Hive-121629 |  show previous shift indicator for new care instructions\n\n* Filter care instructions based on current shift start time\n* Track previous shift instructions separately\n* Display previous shift instruction count in patient summary\n* Change notification text to \"(Includes X from Previous Shift)\"\n* Highlight previous shift notification in red italics\n\n* Hive 121634| Avni | Ability to add more tasks for single day (#100)\n\n* Add bulk task creation with Add More functionality\n\n* Hive-121634| Added styling fixes\n\n* Hive-121634| Added changes for generic tab and css spacing\n\n* Hive-121634| Added text wrap of instruction\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| pr comments\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| pr comments for, removeing dead code, harcoding values and moving css to scss file\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| Added toggle config conditions and replace task-{} with crypto random uuid\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| Restored savenonmedicationtasks for single task\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| Updated failing tests\n\n* Hive-121634|Avni| Resolved pr comment for task row uniqness using crypto random\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Stop pending tasks for a particular instruction (#104)\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Stop pending tasks for a particular instruction\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Updates based on PR review comments\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Updates based on PR Review comments, remove console logs\n\n* Hive-123554| Avni | Ability to add tasks for future dates (#106)\n\n* HIVE-123554 | Add future date scheduling for non-medication tasks\n\n* Hive-123554|Avni|Added cofig related changes for max future days\n\n* Avni | HIVE-123554| Added calender date in nursing tasks, shifted add task button for generic tasks\n\n* Avni | HIVE-123554| Fixed failing tests\n\n* pr comments\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| Resolved infinite loop issue\n\n* pr comments\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| Added css changes for calender and date and creator name\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| Added test cases to cover enabledate both scenarios\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| Refactor fromatted key and translatiosn to have more task(s)\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| pr comments for date and css reafctoring\n\n* Avni |Hive-123554| refactor the max future date to have 60\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Code optimization for stop pending tasks (#109)\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Addressed PR comments to optimize code\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Removing unwanted comments\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Update tests for coverage\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Refactored to remove refetch tasks and setNotificationDirectMessage usage, made some enhancements\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Undo translation formatting\n\n* Pooja | Bug-124991 | Unresponsive Save Button in Task Panel (#110)\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Feature toggle and translation fix (#113)\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Modify default message usage for translation\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Fix for update success message not appearing after updating a Nursing task\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Add feature toggle for Stop tasks\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Fix for menu item not closing on clicking Stop Task\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Add tests for feature toggle\n\n* HIVE-121635: pooja | Vivek: Stop task refactoring (#115)\n\n* Refactor: replace getLocalizedLabel+getTranslationKey with FormattedMessage for static labels\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Refactor: replace getLocalizedLabel with FormattedMessage and remove helper\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Refactor: replace getLocalizedLabel with FormattedMessage and remove helper\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: rename Unstop to Un-Stop Task for consistency\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Pooja | Hive-121635 | Clean up unnecessary code and add translations\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pooja Sastry <pooja.sastry@thoughtworks.com>\n\n* fix: resolve failing tests — add missing mocks, fix href race condition, update snapshots\n\n- Add missing mockSetShowSuccessNotification and mockSetSuccessMessage jest.fn() declarations in UpdateNursingTasks.spec.jsx (introduced but not defined in 8e2c853)\n- Initialize window.location.href with actual patientResponseData encounterUuid in PatientMovementModal.spec.jsx to avoid async race on href assertion\n- Update snapshots for Notification, PatientHeader, and UpdateNursingTasks test suites\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update encounter to Obs Datetime (#135)\n\n* Fix the translation issue for Care View Display control (#136)\n\n* fix: resolve failing tests — remove duplicate mock exports, add missing enableStopTasks, wire taskToFormMapping, update snapshots\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review comments — duplicate locale keys, UNKNOWN_ERROR display, and visitDetails guard\n\n- Remove duplicate IPD_STOP_TASK/IPD_UNSTOP_TASK keys from locale_en, locale_es, locale_fr; keep single canonical values\n- Update defaultMessage in UpdateNursingTasks.jsx from \"Un-Stop Task\" to \"Unstop Task\" to match locale; update tests to match\n- Use handleSetNotificationMessage(\"UNKNOWN_ERROR\") in CareInstructions.jsx so intl.formatMessage runs; add UNKNOWN_ERROR locale key to all three locale files\n- Add optional chaining on visitDetails?.uuid in CareViewPatientsSummary.jsx for style consistency\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: include care instructions in NEW tab filter predicate\n\nPatients with unacknowledged care instructions but no new medications\nwere visible in the ward (warning badge shown) yet hidden from the New\ntab — update the filter to also check careInstructionsMap so such\npatients appear correctly. Add a test covering this case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Avni Tanwar Tw <avni.tanwar@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Nandinidasari60 <dasari.nandini@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pooja Sastry <pooja.sastry@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Soorya Kumaran C <90232857+SooryaKumaranC-tw@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsMV8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgPYQACK4E8/++of0zwU3d0qY9mDu\n6a2qlGHBmcL3M2xg8Qt6LuiiXa5K0tIX83YNNmKTrgV9yiyOL4kzz/ny5TihxKPc\nBku8ebco/JYy64z786i4+nmsI3P3t5HWNA8alHLKpObWtTZE9KI51ywn1kwm6lH