rgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SooryaKumaranC-tw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SooryaKumaranC-tw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SooryaKumaranC-tw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SooryaKumaranC-tw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SooryaKumaranC-tw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/commits/2625042f84677695506be2b632f62e147ade9409/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T10:30:31Z","email":"90232857+SooryaKumaranC-tw@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Soorya Kumaran C"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T10:30:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Amend notes product (#276)\n\n* Note Amendment Feature (#270)\n\n* Vivek: Read provider from IPD context and pass it to amend api (#2)\n\n* Add amend feature behind a config (#1)\n\n* Pooja | Hive-92305 | Feature note acknowledge (#4)\n\n* Pooja | Hive-92305 | Acknowledgment Amendment Note by Supervising Nurse\n\n* Pooja | Hive-92305 | Add tests for acknowledgement slider and make changes suggested in Devbox\n\n* Cherry Pick commit: Implement privilege based Acknowledge option\n\n* Pooja | Hive-95935 | Display History read-only panel view (#6)\n\n* Pooja | Hive-97815 | Display History read-only panel view\n\n* Pooja | Hive-97815 | Add fixes as per recommendations in Devbox\n- Note creator should see the latest amended note (and not original notes) alongwith Amend button\n- Super user or Nurse manager role should see latest amended note only (and not original note) alongwith Acknowledge button\n\n* Pooja | Hive-95935 | Change to show latest amended note above History button in tooltip\n\n* Pooja | Hive-95935 | Update tests\n\n* Pooja | Hive-95935 | Update snapshot\n\n* Fix Legend and date time format (#7)\n\n* Refactor Sliders related code in Amendment flow (#8)\n\n* Soorya | Hive-97812 | Ack deep link (#9)\n\n* Open Acknowledge slider using deep link\n\n* Update the privilege needed to access acknowledge option\n\n* Add some test to validate deep link scenarios\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: SasikiranJ <sasikiran.jakkula@thoughtworks.com>\n\n* Fixed the QA bugs (#11)\n\n* Phanindra | [Hive-101807] | Add ability to view/add multiple Amendments in medication administration (#25)\n\n* Phani | HIVE:101807 | Refactor Administration notes and Time Cell (#27)\n\n* Phani | Add translations for notes (#45)\n\n* Phani | HIVE-111284 | Add translation capability for Amend note (#47)\n\n* Bindu | fix failing test case for amend notes feature\n\n* BAH-4619 translation fetch from config\n\n* BAH-4619 added conditional translation key check for dashboard section\n\n* Update the Amendment reason as a concept dropdown with the fhir api\n\n* Fix the merge conflicts\n\n* Fix the snapshot issue\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Vivek Pandey <32308441+vvkpd@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pooja Sastry <pooja.sastry@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: sasikiran-tw <sasikiran.jakkula@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Phanindra-tw <v.tadikonda@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: binduak <tbindu@thoughtworks.com>\nCo-authored-by: Lingeswaran Subramaniyam <lingeswaran.s@thoughtworks.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ba145580298a0346efabcb4baa55b29b1551c60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/git/trees/7ba145580298a0346efabcb4baa55b29b1551c60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/openmrs-module-ipd-frontend/git/commits/2625042f84677695506be2b632f62e147ade9409","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ba145580298a0346efabcb4baa55b29b1551c60\nparent bead66aa28a9b57d181af4d6f5209361edf16da3\nauthor Soorya Kumaran C <90232857+SooryaKumaranC-tw@users.noreply.github.com> 1787826631 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787826631 +0530\n\nAmend notes product (#276)\n\n* Note Amendment Feature (#270)\