he home page card, the header menu and the\nfooter links.\n\nVisibility is gated purely on establishment rollout via the activeAgencies\nproperty on the CSRA API /info endpoint - no role is required. This follows\nthe same pattern as the Prisoner property tile.\n\nNote that activeAgencies is currently empty in dev, preprod and prod, so\nthe service will not appear anywhere until the CSRA team populates it.\n\n* Update CSRA heading and description for cross-product content alignment\n\n* Update getServicesForUser.test.ts\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jon Brighton <brightonsbox@hotmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf1e39d8ad5d9c48c880c67a3796df9e87f9578a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ministryofjustice/hmpps-micro-frontend-components/git/trees/cf1e39d8ad5d9c48c880c67a3796df9e87f9578a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ministryofjustice/hmpps-micro-frontend-components/git/commits/e1bd95476206d97bc91f0833861e3028c27a6902","verification":{"payload":"tree cf1e39d8ad5d9c48c880c67a3796df9e87f9578a\nparent ac0eb69ae1b1fe03a0ecbc4f174813daa48ddde4\nauthor Michael Willis <michael.willis2@justice.gov.uk> 1786615987 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786615987 +0100\n\nMAPA-184 Add CSRA service to DPS home page, header and footer (#670)\n\n* MAPA-184: Add CSRA service to DPS home page, header and footer\n\nAdds the Cell Sharing Risk Assessment (CSRA) service to the shared\nservice list, which drives the home page card, the header menu and the\nfooter links.\n\nVisibility is gated purely on establishment rollout via the activeAgencies\nproperty on the CSRA API /info endpoint - no role is required. This follows\nthe same pattern as the Prisoner property tile.\n\nNote that activeAgencies is currently empty in dev, preprod and prod, so\nthe service will not appear anywhere until the CSRA team populates it.\n\n* Update CSRA heading and description for cross-product content alignment\n\n* Update getServicesForUser.test.ts\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jon Brighton <bri