s://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/g10101k/Oip/commit/bcecc6a5c5639b403adfa6b42fde4bc60a34fb85","node_id":"C_kwDOJ8F8JtoAKGJjZWNjNmE1YzU2MzliNDAzYWRmYTZiNDJmZGU0YmM2MGEzNGZiODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/g10101k/Oip/commit/563fa56b38bacfde6ef2811d00b146f3fcab2d16","sha":"563fa56b38bacfde6ef2811d00b146f3fcab2d16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/commits/563fa56b38bacfde6ef2811d00b146f3fcab2d16"}],"sha":"bcecc6a5c5639b403adfa6b42fde4bc60a34fb85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/commits/bcecc6a5c5639b403adfa6b42fde4bc60a34fb85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24714459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/g10101k","id":24714459,"login":"g10101k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzE0NDU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/commits/563fa56b38bacfde6ef2811d00b146f3fcab2d16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T07:33:07Z","email":"g101k@mail.ru","name":"Igor Tyulyakov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T07:33:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Extend UI tests and fix issues found by them (#382)\n\n* Ignore local Claude launch settings\n\n* Show disabled applications on the applications management page\n\n- Add get-all-application-registry-items endpoint (admins only) returning disabled applications too\n- Add include_disabled to the gRPC GetApplicationRegistryItems request\n- Use the new endpoint in ApplicationsComponent\n- Cover LocalApplicationRegistryService with unit tests\n\n* Require Internal Base URL when saving an application\n\n* Pass returnUrl to create-auth-session explicitly\n\nThe router may reset the page address before the sign-in form is submitted, so the Referer\nno longer carries the returnUrl. The client now sends it as a query parameter; the Referer\nquery stays as a fallback.\n\n* Add endpoint to send a test notification to the current user\n\nAdmins can check portal notification delivery without setting up a notification template.\n\n* Remove standalone profile route\n\nThe user profile is shown on the configuration page, which the top bar profile button opens.\n\n* Add test selectors to discussion, notifications, security and weather module components\n\n- qa-id attributes for discussion and user notifications elements\n- Security multiselect ids and tracking by module right code instead of name\n- Id for the weather forecast module settings save button\n\n* Extend test container for UI tests\n\n- Add a non-admin ''user'' account to the oip realm\n- Add MinIO for user photos and discussion attachments\n- Allow two sessions on the Chrome node\n- Add UserUsername, UserPassword and TestHost run parameters\n- Document test users, object storage and servers started by the tests\n\n* Extend UI tests and move them to page objects\n\n- Page objects for Keycloak login, top bar, side menu, dialogs and application pages\n- Sign in as admin or a regular user via TestUser and SignInAs\n- New suites: auth flow, role access, smoke, start page, applications, config, DB migration,\n  discussion, module registry/security/settings, notifications, sessions and user profile\n- Read browser console in smoke tests; serve a module manifest from the test process","tree":{"sha":"3aafa4ae8b8e8a6099774f9ec36358ac94a6d58e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/trees/3aafa4ae8b8e8a6099774f9ec36358ac94a6d58e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/commits/563fa56b38bacfde6ef2811d00b146f3fcab2d16","verification":{"payload":"tree 3aafa4ae8b8e8a6099774f9ec36358ac94a6d58e\nparent efc4a2640da26533a9dba613cc17bdf99d8d3a53\nauthor Igor Tyulyakov <g101k@mail.ru> 1791099187 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791099187 +0300\n\nExtend UI tests and fix issues found by them (#382)\n\n* Ignore local Claude launch settings\n\n* Show disabled applications on the applications management page\n\n- Add get-all-application-registry-items endpoint (admins only) returning disabled applications too\n- Add include_disabled to the gRPC GetApplicationRegistryItems request\n- Use the new endpoint in ApplicationsComponent\n- Cover LocalApplicationRegistryService with unit tests\n\n* Require Internal Base URL when saving an application\n\n* Pass returnUrl to create-auth-session explicitly\n\nThe router may reset the page address before the sign-in form is submitted, so the Referer\nno longer carries the returnUrl. The client now sends it as a query parameter; the Referer\nquery stays as a fallback.\n\n* Add endpoint to send a test notification to the current user\n\nAdmins can check portal notification delivery without setting up a notification template.\n\n* Remove standalone profile route\n\nThe user profile is shown on the configuration page, which the top bar profile button opens.\n\n* Add test selectors to discussion, notifications, security and weather module components\n\n- qa-id attributes for discussion and user notifications elements\n- Security multiselect ids and tracking by module right code instead of name\n- Id for the weather forecast module settings save button\n\n* Extend test container for UI tests\n\n- Add a non-admin ''user'' account to the oip realm\n- Add MinIO for user photos and discussion attachments\n- Allow two sessions on the Chrome node\n- Add UserUsername, UserPassword and TestHost run parameters\n- Document test users, object storage and servers started by the tests\n\n* Extend UI tests and move them to page objects\n\n- Page objects for Keycloak login, top bar, side menu, dialogs and application pages\n- Sign in as admin or a regular user via TestUser and SignInAs\n- New suites: auth flow, role access, smoke, start page, applications, config, DB migration,\n  discussion, module registry/security/settings, notifications, sessions and user profile\n- Read browser console in smoke tests; serve a module manifest from the test process","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwgEzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsS4QAJr2NfytGG+voWzkkNalWxLD\nU6L3IBv3LsTEdOPHhSkzzgb9p+Q4zasmyBD8oE651jCUVaaBVHlIsNoJU/SH3Jvu\nHApR/EFsh3KeOiLHH6OUSlp6OTPexU/OQInbeJxj9/67hWJKqHvbZPAEsfQyiFZ7\nH7rxBf2A1pTkyI2FyFpJrzuu5MhqxD6Insc3bI+gom+JXY76P0L9qGdLgk2p3izj\n/lAfpHsC+0vXoKWp82OrMq0pD/VLhBcRzTbpLvl6KAg+df+t6qwFVJw+dHTSEkAJ\nZagxUS9RRjLqbBZAuRxAN37nVaj6jNNCwnWypb7FMis6W0nMqMDviJNVKKujaiYO\nCE2ZuwUtbawatiGB2UlxNI5TUwzZyXp87TSFm5395hkog30K8va2fefM6ZkYIoLa\nm/EO4CjVGTpPO3ZSatfksuRUrpClafp08USdp7aJQgrtBaZM92mmWPovYLD9Su59\new9ouh2rLK8ZMXyyQF6+Gz+qPaiv2/eQUAQ8+unB7B++pt2Cx0tXf3cfVqUVL6YQ\nMn8eqmOFvIz/kuxUWzx6mGHK3jbLpsQS6SU5bTsnXmahD4bYo2gt+DWyOWtKXVKe\nkllNLe8MAy7QPNWkYm+FFUDptTAoD22l9NWD/th3wUD1almb5fyxXtUTeGS24STA\n7IaO4/9BrLP7LZFUVM/X\n=ZzRu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T07:33:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id"