er","url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/commits/efc4a2640da26533a9dba613cc17bdf99d8d3a53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:08:37Z","email":"g101k@mail.ru","name":"Igor Tyulyakov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:08:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Folder as a dedicated menu item type (#381)\n\n* Folder as a dedicated menu item type (#380)\n\n- Allow only Folder instances at the menu root and as parents of child items, validated in `ModuleRepository.AddModuleInstance` and returned as 400/404 `ApiExceptionResponse`\n- Reject Folder as a start module in `SetStartModule` (400)\n- Add `IsFolder` to `ModuleInstanceDto` and `ModuleKeyValueDto`, add `ModuleConstants.FolderModuleName`\n- Make `ModuleInstanceEntity.Settings` nullable\n- Add `FolderOnlyMenuRoot` migrations for Postgres and SqlServer: create the Folder module record if missing, switch root instances and instances with children to Folder with `Settings = NULL`, drop start modules pointing to folders\n- Show \"New\" only on folders, restrict the create dialog to Folder at the root, never treat a folder as a start page; regenerate Angular client\n- Add unit tests for the folder rules\n\nCloses #380\n\n* Translate prepare-release skill docs to English and delete obsolete task.md.","tree":{"sha":"278e977aa615c3fb6beb2b07f69631efa9a715ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/trees/278e977aa615c3fb6beb2b07f69631efa9a715ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/commits/efc4a2640da26533a9dba613cc17bdf99d8d3a53","verification":{"payload":"tree 278e977aa615c3fb6beb2b07f69631efa9a715ee\nparent c87787da667f7bd0d2c952a1698a5e4925534aea\nauthor Igor Tyulyakov <g101k@mail.ru> 1791025717 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791025717 +0300\n\nFolder as a dedicated menu item type (#381)\n\n* Folder as a dedicated menu item type (#380)\n\n- Allow only Folder instances at the menu root and as parents of child items, validated in `ModuleRepository.AddModuleInstance` and returned as 400/404 `ApiExceptionResponse`\n- Reject Folder as a start module in `SetStartModule` (400)\n- Add `IsFolder` to `ModuleInstanceDto` and `ModuleKeyValueDto`, add `ModuleConstants.FolderModuleName`\n- Make `ModuleInstanceEntity.Settings` nullable\n- Add `FolderOnlyMenuRoot` migrations for Postgres and SqlServer: create the Folder module record if missing, switch root instances and instances with children to Folder with `Settings = NULL`, drop start modules pointing to folders\n- Show \"New\" only on folders, restrict the create dialog to Folder at the root, never treat a folder as a start page; regenerate Angular client\n- Add unit tests for the folder rules\n\nCloses #380\n\n* Translate prepare-release skill docs to English and delete obsolete task.md.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwOI1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3WcQAGLlvnKvPtxK9MJ0xll79l4J\n4wmYN48Cgzl2AAa/mf8gS4MKZBvbD4LxpKy3tpS/p1Q3Kv/zIJbTYv8g2/a5+9Wf\npuvL1JDloKSNK9EhcqZicYo2XsKhusG6w/aoyvVb462RK+XqjhtPUt7v4N8KCg0z\nY3ETQaimnKnZ+2jeEYZbb73tZ5P8GhqIRnHg26MU/Zjir/U8TSaFqtTk+fLB5ii9\nmCESQW12oFBGH5yZazHwJbwKsWkf9iurePPHm68vLdYmfeOfTgv5tNpElKcmXeSt\nkRzfuq1rAiUaMGv+3MWObDCAYGthqEDsfY/6/bsLqa5VUMxG8GP1xEq9Vnq8oEN0\nghTwr59BJDh/L1BV75ZoK4NKoAVhyQSHYRd0p3VsT6+1nJ22/w3NEuQgr5sEMFGu\nLx8hpJQ5MsRC3/BbCIRNVO9pX4WxjUytsjmRdpLtAzDvIBodl9FC6cfxrHVxeZyi\n/WFq87UtoJXs+0T8MWqcfzg1jJI5GpwoTEFwKw4V1aF298bjbpZC8oUyDtZuJWLz\nhI0PFdFQgAx1sb/BgMza5GFsNWo5L1E38UlwNpOOZnrEtLHvKa3Pd54Z3e6GItVx\ny1uEGCjR70mD2wDy0hLQphOawtPSUk7qHP5ilO5cqhvG2f/iXXLL5uDWQmIYD8Kp\nufymOzRz3GFeWyMim0fj\n=Bx0l\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T11:08:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.gi