/api.github.com/users/g10101k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/commits/d5f0d406a39693619cabe6fe857afca2b41c4dd0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:23:30Z","email":"g101k@mail.ru","name":"Igor Tyulyakov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:23:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix the untranslated key on a failed user photo load (#363)\n\nUserService.getUserPhoto reported the error with\n''profileComponent.failedToLoadPhoto'', but that namespace is registered by\nUserProfileComponent''s provideTranslations field initializer, so it only\nexists once that component has been constructed. The service fires from\nits own constructor, on the first emission of getCurrentUser$, long\nbefore the profile page is ever opened - translateService.instant then\nreturns the key itself, which the toast shows as both summary and detail.\n\nMove the key to the services dictionary, which L10nService merges in its\nown constructor and which is therefore available to any service.","tree":{"sha":"86dae249cf945619c00570522b7cade0b4da8f9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/trees/86dae249cf945619c00570522b7cade0b4da8f9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/commits/d5f0d406a39693619cabe6fe857afca2b41c4dd0","verification":{"payload":"tree 86dae249cf945619c00570522b7cade0b4da8f9d\nparent 508edd2a62348f370dc0d794331875993dfbeb28\nauthor Igor Tyulyakov <g101k@mail.ru> 1789064610 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789064610 +0300\n\nFix the untranslated key on a failed user photo load (#363)\n\nUserService.getUserPhoto reported the error with\n''profileComponent.failedToLoadPhoto'', but that namespace is registered by\nUserProfileComponent''s provideTranslations field initializer, so it only\nexists once that component has been constructed. The service fires from\nits own constructor, on the first emission of getCurrentUser$, long\nbefore the profile page is ever opened - translateService.instant then\nreturns the key itself, which the toast shows as both summary and detail.\n\nMove the key to the services dictionary, which L10nService merges in its\nown constructor and which is therefore available to any service.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqovWiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8xIQAI8yZW07pk7OZw4VX/8uIjgQ\navYm0cj6v8oGtbGPjPrjH4gYdbrlgBb5rnDS53RdF0TfO6HTD+/sscaWYUXOK3JG\nxcz9v8n7OU5JLEkUb+huWZ8xgkCij+lpyH87qj8wtO7ildh4mND24KDq7MnkvDOF\nkEq9rv4Dr3qvwlRpCtvbxfmmDqNBnwwfF5C7UEoG4c15LVGGgjynT/9w2MwbtpEQ\nHPHIAQEJfIisAW5Ueu5yoRxwr8n6VMxI7kkcGvKqMvfcwbrJtv2woeuN8mvkF0Bw\nFKaxsloplczWBb3O4+JIZbC30baGC1giu746dI730gyJy71h6DgJ3tmfUN6p7ft/\nhcwFb/RMcX8HSdVQWBk1AqVnNHnGKPUJjiDGaBm/jdtBDWCFAqArXKfBJO/TgZLJ\nn+yGornqaFv8s7Oa5tP2Fy1UAqkrSdTqQFjQu4jS+qegwcDhBAyjsxu2NjxcPIXf\nxse1v1EQ9XdaNtRjzSMLXjWwKat+zP5OS0OfkQebx50c8UIE602R9XFG4W/f1BPB\n/1M01s8W7aMXe92i/yR8BhtIGJUcu8xxtq5FpcEZMgxxMQlsBiNT7s1ohx1wuYEQ\n/NG29ip6N3exWMxneRz4Sb/JhS0HRW8UhfORSN+bEsrjXwzvzdcM7iucNOfVKRQh\ni4f+SOs1BSyo2SWIO5TA\n=NFrf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T18:23:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/g10101k/Oip/commit/d5f0d406a39693619cabe6fe857afca2b41c4dd0","node_id":"C_kwDOJ8F8JtoAKGQ1ZjBkNDA2YTM5NjkzNjE5Y2FiZTZmZTg1N2FmY2EyYjQxYzRkZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/g10101k/Oip/commit/508edd2a62348f370dc0d794331875993dfbeb28","sha":"508edd2a62348f370dc0d794331875993dfbeb28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/commits/508edd2a62348f370dc0d794331875993dfbeb28"}],"sha":"d5f0d406a39693619cabe6fe857afca2b41c4dd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/commits/d5f0d406a39693619cabe6fe857afca2b41c4dd0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24714459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/g10101k","id":24714459,"login":"g10101k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzE0NDU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/commits/508edd2a62348f370dc0d794331875993dfbeb28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:23:16Z","email":"g101k@mail.ru","name":"Igor Tyulyakov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T18:23:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Upgrade solution to .NET 10 (#362)\n\n.NET 8 goes out of support on 10 November 2026 and Oip.Settings 3.0.0\ntargets net10.0 without multi-targeting, so the solution has to move.\n\n- Replace src/Common.props with src/Directory.Build.props, which now owns\n  the target framework and the shared build and package properties for\n  every project instead of the 12 that imported Common.props.\n- Add src/Directory.Packages.props and switch to Central Package\n  Management. Versions that had drifted apart are unified: NUnit,\n  NUnit3TestAdapter, NUnit.Analyzers, Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk and\n  Grpc.Net.Client now have a single version across the solution.\n- Move Microsoft.* packages to 10.0.12 and Oip.Settings to 3.0.0.\n  Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.* goes to 5.0.0 because EF Core 10 requires it,\n  and OpenTelemetry to 1.18.0, which clears advisory GHSA-g94r-2vxg-569j.\n- Bump Swashbuckle.AspNetCore to 10.2.3. ASP.NET Core 10 brings\n  Microsoft.OpenApi 2.x, which 8.1.4 cannot load, so the security\n  requirement is now built from OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference and the\n  document is serialized with SerializeAsJsonAsync.\n- Drop Microsoft.AspNetCore.Grpc.Swagger. Its latest release still binds\n  to Swashbuckle 6.6.2 and threw a TypeLoadException at startup against\n  Swashbuckle 10. Nothing called AddGrpcSwagger, so the reference was\n  dead weight.\n- Replace the APIs .NET 10 deprecates: KnownNetworks with KnownIPNetworks,\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.HttpOverrides.IPNetwork with System.Net.IPNetwork,\n  and drop the deprecated WithOpenApi call on the health endpoint.\n- Update the seven Dockerfiles, the three workflows and the READMEs.\n- Regenerate the Angular clients. The only change is TableQueryRequest\n  filters losing its nullable marker, which matches the non-nullable\n  Dictionary on the C# model.\n\nOip.Test opts out of nullable reference types explicitly: it was written\nwithout them and the shared default would otherwise flood it with warnings.\n\nCloses #361","tree":{"sha":"ab713492d0213ca0f0e947c6bcc56ecb560ac566","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/trees/ab713492d0213ca0f0e947c6bcc56ecb560ac566"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/commits/508edd2a62348f370dc0d794331875993dfbeb28","verification":{"payload":"tree ab713492d0213ca0f0e947c6bcc56ecb560ac566\nparent 79ed93f269b5ca1a0bb3e3c3517a4bc933ff51b0\nauthor Igor Tyulyakov <g101k@mail.ru> 1789064596 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789064596 +0300\n\nUpgrade solution to .NET 10 (#362)\n\n.NET 8 goes out of support on 10 November 2026 and Oip.Settings 3.0.0\ntargets net10.0 without multi-targeting, so the solution has to move.\n\n- Replace src/Common.props with src/Directory.Build.props, which now owns\n  the target framework and the shared build and package properties for\n  every project instead of the 12 that imported Common.props.\n- Add src/Directory.Packages.props and switch to Central Package\n  Management. Versions that had drifted apart are unified: NUnit,\n  NUnit3TestAdapter, NUnit.Analyzers, Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk and\n  Grpc.Net.Client now have a single version across the solution.\n- Move Microsoft.* packages to 10.0.12 and Oip.Settings to 3.0.0.\n  Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.* goes to 5.0.0 because EF Core 10 requires it,\n  and OpenTelemetry to 1.18.0, which clears advisory GHSA-g94r-2vxg-569j.\n- Bump Swashbuckle.AspNetCore to 10.2.3. ASP.NET Core 10 brings\n  Microsoft.OpenApi 2.x, which 8.1.4 cannot load, so the security\n  requirement is now built from OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference and the\n  document is serialized with SerializeAsJsonAsync.\n- Drop Microsoft.AspNetCore.Grpc.Swagger. Its latest release still binds\n  to Swashbuckle 6.6.2 and threw a TypeLoadException at startup against\n  Swashbuckle 10. Nothing called AddGrpcSwagger, so the reference was\n  dead weight.\n- Replace the APIs .NET 10 deprecates: KnownNetworks with KnownIPNetworks,\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.HttpOverrides.IPNetwork with System.Net.IPNetwork,\n  and drop the deprecated WithOpenApi call on the health endpoint.\n- Update the seven Dockerfiles, the three workflows and the READMEs.\n- Regenerate the Angular clients. The only change is TableQueryRequest\n  filters losing its nullable marker, which matches the non-nullable\n  Dictionary on the C# model.\n\nOip.Test opts out of nullable reference types explicitly: it was written\nwithout them and the shared default would otherwise flood it with warnings.\n\nCloses #361","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqovWUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA534QADmAD9HWztycy53XJrQxAJri\n5O3voO5ECJyvt1mXdzt8tQ3qqTpjQKwmLVm1q38q6xuFB+O8M2wIMJZEQzwAnZHh\nRwyt2WLA9N8mItABXGwmKVA21uFfYm1k1wjxKZQzU1v8+lKeSyuoPgJ0dchsSUsb\nZzaJ6YiDfg6HXSef4bswLQaPpW5xxxbWRTfbdg5h6k6HOoHUQZfHJqHGfMDnA7Nl\ncNsnAXLjBXSPOoXP3YxPsCwbo54T5JJ6UZlZugJBWuC/kmpZJrEIB1WOVFazuT3t\nZ4hrKXFCPRKU5v1CT9bE5QlAFwseRrWLI26f0V/LLdZHqdYqrVQjaDfdrScrQswY\nppwH2N2pTWbQjYmISFSIkH8mQ/4X98spYpENw23yXLflL51PSHXWN9O28nND5Px5\nxxC/ZuGpcekRU0Tv/Hn9LKxeGxVCNUxPlhIBjh0Q9xq8UqUluA2JrsasbPmhaM4t\nVTCSH1cIQl/N0dLWoNBy5mB2LYmpYsnvd2kQ8VVNEKb8RPeyESteLA7QjzR6z587\nBpTx2g5x1xQvJo3hJ+dI110lqqwWov7+mzFVLNCEZwwpCvqV0MssXqMQVfQ3gxfq\ntoPhO7MEG12Ew9Lb3CAQZCNNtVynWqIAbz5cGmZEst7kWvqZBEwRHnJsFOEisJp1\ns+HfG66UjKEFB/1u4578\n=k1mt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T18:23:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3