ot affected.\n\n* Show edited module in menu item edit dialog and drop start page star\n\nThe edit dialog now displays the module of the edited instance in a\ndisabled field. The start page marker is no longer rendered in the menu;\nthe context menu actions stay unchanged.\n\n* Highlight root menu items on hover and disable parent field\n\nRoot menu labels now get the same hover background as nested items. The\nparent node field in the create dialog is disabled instead of readonly so\nit no longer looks editable.","tree":{"sha":"dbd3a999b32b235b049405e51858e8ea967fd2e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/trees/dbd3a999b32b235b049405e51858e8ea967fd2e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/commits/83b515d642b6f1e0ecbc62323919297815af7cf8","verification":{"payload":"tree dbd3a999b32b235b049405e51858e8ea967fd2e7\nparent 2a4c87017b67b54d99ac62cdc707ab7b3dc6a8ac\nauthor Igor Tyulyakov <g101k@mail.ru> 1788615225 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788615225 +0300\n\n344 setup default module for root path (#346)\n\n* Add UserStartModule for default user module configuration\n\n* Create UserStartModule entity and database configuration\n* Add migrations for SQL Server and PostgreSQL\n* Add IsStart property to ModuleInstanceDto\n\n* Implement start module management endpoints\n\n* Implement start module selection and default landing page routing\n\n* Use Keycloak subject for user identification and settings management\n\n* Fix missing read roles in module instance edit dialog\n\nGetAdminMenu did not include instance securities, so the edit dialog\nshowed an empty role list. Scope the menu DTO roles and the edit update\nto the read right so other rights are not affected.\n\n* Show edited module in menu item edit dialog and drop start page star\n\nThe edit dialog now displays the module of the edited instance in a\ndisabled field. The start page marker is no longer rendered in the menu;\nthe context menu actions stay unchanged.\n\n* Highlight root menu items on hover and disable parent field\n\nRoot menu labels now get the same hover background as nested items. The\nparent node field in the create dialog is disabled instead of readonly so\nit no longer looks editable.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnBo6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArfEQAJW0sd5FoRWBVDq5BAf5o29t\nJfWmoszJM7I+EObTityvtZDXXm2MbBTar4YFeVhyxVIClrycjvEVjmVoIlZ+0wwJ\n0QHdZsvabXGMDg1k6bz5fNzafGeDufuqhkSRQeW0AQR5ZikSRluWe3Jho6hP9QMm\nx/LT0UjkMFm8e5wayXDOAA1k19bVJQ5dqYRHIcH9mDVZT2fvtm8m1GAsKbiJwqYm\nSxy46mitZeSGTs53FRd43zYVO95q4iKSnwRTR/lnzVGo8y7thP6V5RJD0bPCnJNV\n0ria5dOdlq/iE6otIyUj5dQHe9CcaD0cTHE6FO+YZ12P9pA2tVl+PdbAE28+1Vei\nDPZKqI1f7mQdYK6xlqvFWVdQxgRAOpUiMsjMGPxk4ETP2PuKG/eCkFLZpgl+Bh7H\nP8tXTZyFthMERPqA7xlHVJGrTNm2EoYsgxiys1q0x+rzR8mqM+NilTf9PTcdZpkl\n2bDAQoQW0DWlDJQLVNAeMnCt8dcLqL8ObcooEIQKwXj69k1PIEo/vGeGpOgLl83T\nBCw7Jffv8meTjo8w/BWl4flwKxdoEYRPcM2HmnNaZuLKvUGV8cQ5suGw/Lmw31gJ\nKIZjske0nj7In+Rcqv4IPTWPLgKDST1myTZOHsuJW32V1OMotsm+1bbD6Gw5q9aV\n5oI08v3govzv6p/Q4xio\n=8dB5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-05T13:33:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions