date":"2026-09-03T20:30:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Release from tag (#340)\n\n* Resolve oip-common from the workspace instead of the registry\n\nThe web client depended on its own published oip-common package, so a release\ncould not be built before it was published. The library is now resolved through\na tsconfig path to dist, and the asset, style and module federation references\nfollow.\n\n* Add release workflow for v* tags\n\nPublishes NuGet packages and oip-common from a single tagged run, checking that\nthe tag matches Common.props and that all versions are in sync. npm publish uses\ntrusted publishing, so package-lock.json is now tracked to let CI run npm ci.\n\n* Add package-lock\n\n* tempory disable","tree":{"sha":"0d7a8d674e63cd47ac27b06f2331ec9b868cd188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/trees/0d7a8d674e63cd47ac27b06f2331ec9b868cd188"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/commits/ab9640e8404fec65af4e26515b4b3bb931066296","verification":{"payload":"tree 0d7a8d674e63cd47ac27b06f2331ec9b868cd188\nparent 03e4bffb486fc87d88ecd23552057b43b675ba11\nauthor Igor Tyulyakov <g101k@mail.ru> 1788467425 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788467425 +0300\n\nRelease from tag (#340)\n\n* Resolve oip-common from the workspace instead of the registry\n\nThe web client depended on its own published oip-common package, so a release\ncould not be built before it was published. The library is now resolved through\na tsconfig path to dist, and the asset, style and module federation references\nfollow.\n\n* Add release workflow for v* tags\n\nPublishes NuGet packages and oip-common from a single tagged run, checking that\nthe tag matches Common.props and that all versions are in sync. npm publish uses\ntrusted publishing, so package-lock.json is now tracked to let CI run npm ci.\n\n* Add package-lock\n\n* tempory disable","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmd