"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/commits/de87ce3f389100be150ce8cb9e34a08d13633b0d"}],"sha":"200c82c3b1ef45fb5dce622f65b363cb6da98b5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/commits/200c82c3b1ef45fb5dce622f65b363cb6da98b5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24714459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/g10101k","id":24714459,"login":"g10101k","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzE0NDU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/g10101k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/commits/de87ce3f389100be150ce8cb9e34a08d13633b0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:41:40Z","email":"g101k@mail.ru","name":"Igor Tyulyakov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:41:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"RTDS implement all types storage and calc (#334)\n\n* Write tag values through a batching background writer\n\nInsert path no longer opens a ClickHouse connection per request:\n- RtdsWriteQueue (bounded Channel) buffers incoming values\n- RtdsWriterHostedService drains it in batches over a long-lived\n  connection, grouping by value type and retrying on failure\n- RtdsContext opens its connection lazily and asynchronously,\n  reopening it when broken, and no longer swallows insert errors\n- batch size, flush interval and retries are configurable\n\n* Make tag value inserts idempotent and compress values by type\n\nInsert deduplication tokens let a retried batch be discarded by\nClickHouse instead of duplicating rows, so batches are split by\npartition to keep each insert a single block. Value columns get a\ncodec chosen by tag type and are no longer Nullable, with absence\nencoded by the Status column.\n\n* Add other types","tree":{"sha":"b861ae9dfa2f59adb132a6b269e2dfe6a5cf1e15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/trees/b861ae9dfa2f59adb132a6b269e2dfe6a5cf1e15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g10101k/Oip/git/commits/de87ce3f389100be150ce8cb9e34a08d13633b0d","verification":{"payload":"tree b861ae9dfa2f59adb132a6b269e2dfe6a5cf1e15\nparent be1bdb249aca140fa71d886ba48581482a5dac09\nauthor Igor Tyulyakov <g101k@mail.ru> 1788111700 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788111700 +0300\n\nRTDS implement all types storage and calc (#334)\n\n* Write tag values through a batching background writer\n\nInsert path no longer opens a ClickHouse connection per request:\n- RtdsWriteQueue (bounded Channel) buffers incoming values\n- RtdsWriterHostedService drains it in batches over a long-lived\n  connection, grouping by value type and retrying on failure\n- RtdsContext opens its connection lazily and asynchronously,\n  reopening it when broken, and no longer swallows insert errors\n- batch size, flush interval and retries are configurable\n\n* Make tag value inserts idempotent and compress values by type\n\nInsert deduplication tokens let a retried batch be discarded by\nClickHouse instead of duplicating rows, so batches are split by\npartition to keep each insert a single block. Value columns get a\ncodec chosen by tag type and are no longer Nullable, with absence\nencoded by the Status column.\n\n* Add other types","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlGtUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMo4QADhaN6pF8GuCcOnpG