081\nAdd Unleash feature flag `platform.chatbot.arh-default` to control\nboth the chatbot dropdown ordering and the ARH \"Preview\" badge.\n\nFlag ON: ARH appears first, isPreview=false (current behavior).\nFlag OFF: VA appears first, ARH shows \"Preview\" badge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(chatbot): extract ARH default flag key to shared constant\n\nRHCLOUD-48081\nPrevents typo-induced desync between useArhClient and useStateManager\nby centralizing the flag key in a single flags module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8137b7931eb09bba543a6dff0cdc269633261942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/git/trees/8137b7931eb09bba543a6dff0cdc269633261942"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/git/commits/33977862bb6dbf461634a4f02a66dfd6a0392f8f","verification":{"payload":"tree 8137b7931eb09bba543a6dff0cdc269633261942\nparent fa98bd8c273ee5b10e75c79e958a81a482b17ad9\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1783511594 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783511594 +0200\n\nfeat(chatbot): gate ARH ordering and preview behind flag (#399)\n\n* feat(chatbot): gate ARH-first ordering and preview behind feature flag\n\nRHCLOUD-48081\nAdd Unleash feature flag `platform.chatbot.arh-default` to control\nboth the chatbot dropdown ordering and the ARH \"Preview\" badge.\n\nFlag ON: ARH appears first, isPreview=false (current behavior).\nFlag OFF: VA appears first, ARH shows \"Preview\" badge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(chatbot): extract ARH default flag key to shared constant\n\nRHCLOUD-48081\nPrevents typo-induced desync between useArhClient and useStateManager\nby centralizing the flag key in a single flags module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthrop