/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/git/trees/8e45303869bc622a9d048af19747140a0df3f900"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/git/commits/449228bf8620f8ae9086c8d402c9aa9f53171734","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e45303869bc622a9d048af19747140a0df3f900\nparent 5a1429119ad3998458df68e850eda8bf668446ea\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1780072518 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780072518 +0200\n\nfix(deps): override dompurify to ^3.4.0 for CVE-2026-41240 (#391)\n\nRHCLOUD-47324\nDOMPurify <3.4.0 has XSS via inconsistent FORBID_TAGS handling\nwhen function-based ADD_TAGS is used. monaco-editor@0.54.0 pins\ndompurify to 3.1.7, so npm overrides are needed to force >=3.4.0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGcBGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAb0AQAH29r+vuofpI0tmbRf95q15n\nnZmXnTbqaf7hFBNerSMdb+u8MIU/G0H7hwNlpxfpImQfrVrqGIRSFu7XtR664HHy\nbuDcsBNkw28CZwsO6XP3mwzW2oooHqDQf8gcTcZ2hwIBDkHeeveFzKInfJ/+++N1\nUh1u/7hKFSUM+yHFar1Cyn2RzkIz5XlJkCnLKH73VypnojnetukA2rnUa5vKjuHS\nlR8wnQ2vrTZoxSxlQTnhbxo7b5SlfzgUenj351gmEoMPvgT7nMS9S/JUCiw6CPgF\nikONzIlc9nTt2UBypCxARA7Anqv5BYw6t+hmyCGoMlv3OPv4tcI3vDlBkB/j6hh0\nC0kcNRozPTr/wAWY7uASDmAvulVgCb+SWjhP6gGX/UH2JQ+dFYIQjavH/Q4vsD6l\n5pStWRHtkvzAFwIow/mMP5/2RAMMXsWupUZe6GL8bkqc+S7mwjUq10tjKJDmLIqG\nL1TVB95iepYfZ4apOgYGP/hF21nnum12uiOO49qhq4sPnBN60bbFZbM8WGNnwIdP\n9UnzI/RtMcI0csUqaCq0YhJZLdBbBaE+WssYL2vjTczEVw+f4sZc380fSKMaWq3P\nwoDQZfwUzpMDf/U/crcqNdW47TRiUoGbKLZ1BtLWsma3uTdKgL9LMvYtjU7/bt4g\n986ti080y0zT3vlLJz0z\n=EDi1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T16:35:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/