 fix(chatbot): use dark-mode-aware token for assistant switcher bg\n\nRHCLOUD-47992\nReplace --pf-t--global--background--color--300 (not remapped in dark\nmode) with --pf-t--global--background--color--secondary--default which\nadapts correctly under .pf-v6-theme-dark.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(chatbot): use floating token for assistant switcher bg\n\nRHCLOUD-47992\nUse --pf-t--global--background--color--floating--default instead of\n--secondary--default so the assistant switcher visually separates from\nthe chatbot background in dark mode. The floating token is what PF6\nmenus use for elevated surfaces.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6bedf847d07bc5f20dd97be3e09c6c4f3c8959cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/git/trees/6bedf847d07bc5f20dd97be3e09c6c4f3c8959cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/git/commits/25f88a3bf338409549a9e0ba7150a62ab2f40466","verification":{"payload":"tree 6bedf847d07bc5f20dd97be3e09c6c4f3c8959cf\nparent 968883fffd8fafd27573f4f7c5979209f0e11484\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1779978649 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779978649 +0200\n\nfix(chatbot): dark mode assistant switcher background (#388)\n\n* fix(chatbot): use dark-mode-aware token for assistant switcher bg\n\nRHCLOUD-47992\nReplace --pf-t--global--background--color--300 (not remapped in dark\nmode) with --pf-t--global--background--color--secondary--default which\nadapts correctly under .pf-v6-theme-dark.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(chatbot): use floating token for assistant switcher bg\n\nRHCLOUD-47992\nUse --pf-t--global--background--color--floating--default instead of\n--secondary--default so the assistant switcher visually separates from\nthe chatbot background in dark mode. The floating token is what PF6\nmenus use for elevated surfaces.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGFGZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIfIQAI4nxS1lFAH1kHwfHIi0idH9\n8MBi0NB59z1QRgCx/P12f7XtH5nEoBpGtlTlYStsiGTyEDBuhvaIEULvEM07boi8\n+Gm88RQ+iGpxVu9cSMkWJTIPDGDkZC3EVHJ6adX+6Aqimnknz40VZ+neyTn/cAT7\nPK8lMTrUs9kz5najDyeOYQKIRfen+UoQYk71fZd6B5YIW7T0P2nquhUIm57xABQ4\nWgmq9pgf1btg7ZjQlX6mxMxunzmFcmFoPuSrZcaazkNnwG5Pbexstku9ey0zgQxx\n3qcMJQblXPMMBvdHx9dt4jJNt1VeXxwFiuLebf95IfQx3qW0Y8ZYIcLt2/zqx0/M\nUTIWCr8fGbZY6/czloMALvVAUOhbyGF8oG30N7G/0rrXKf6Mr8Qp1xT44FLZBiKt\nEviity1KtQNtOtZO3d49UhIbaxV/MKytjSmuFDRjzm7LGan3LKqApoxdof6ALZ4e\nkSMb31VdIdK/nGdZOYxfDRQM3bLWRfok7J3i44PZnsTYvlxe3sj7uWW/R1WUCwrX\nEz6Tc3+SzPmXCWeoeSgsdGXi+eeplZnpRmjkr25gtLmxAq5Wa1MVecqtLkP1FI2D\nXz+fbHn0IcIltSdGejABS3AbDp7K1RshVSKJgyttkDFIdUx/CUCZ2YwBoaDmKynt\nQvZVVTA8wzaBGZf3jlVC\n=HGNO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-28T14:30:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","u