e":"2026-05-28T13:14:15Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"Řehoř"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T13:14:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(VAEmbed): add hideHeader prop (#386)\n\n* feat(VAEmbed): add hideHeader prop to hide chatbot header\n\nRHCLOUD-47952\nAdd hideHeader prop to VAEmbed and UniversalChatbot to allow\nembedding contexts to hide the brand icon, model name, and close\nbutton. When true, the UniversalHeader is not rendered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(state): move hideHeader from prop to singleton state\n\nRHCLOUD-47952\nUse VirtualAssistantStateSingleton for header visibility instead of\npassing hideHeader as a component prop. Adds useHideHeader hook and\nstatic setHideHeader method so consumers can control header visibility\nthrough the existing state management system.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Karel Hala <khala@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b4a8e64965ffcdc28f814e143a960e8e499e88a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/git/trees/2b4a8e64965ffcdc28f814e143a960e8e499e88a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/git/commits/968883fffd8fafd27573f4f7c5979209f0e11484","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b4a8e64965ffcdc28f814e143a960e8e499e88a\nparent 76a1c7b713eedcdc4302b46ae355013562db40d4\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1779974055 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779974055 +0200\n\nfeat(VAEmbed): add hideHeader prop (#386)\n\n* feat(VAEmbed): add hideHeader prop to hide chatbot header\n\nRHCLOUD-47952\nAdd hideHeader prop to VAEmbed and UniversalChatbot to allow\nembedding contexts to hide the brand icon, model name, and close\nbutton. When true, the UniversalHeader is not rendered.\n\nCo-Autho