thub.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/commits/8af94f9e1f52fa8fd57808d9a3a56f5fdeca9675"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273054389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/platex-rehor-bot","id":273054389,"login":"platex-rehor-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOEEZ6tQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/commits/a69201c9ecaddd7f8ba732ccf047f2d99dde61df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:10:52Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"Řehoř"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:10:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(va-embed): separate virtualAssistant wrapper from va-embed div (#384)\n\nRHCLOUD-47504\n\nThe sassPrefix build config wraps all SCSS selectors as descendants\nof .virtualAssistant. When both .virtualAssistant and .va-embed were\non the same DOM element, the compiled CSS selector\n.virtualAssistant .va-embed never matched because it requires\n.va-embed to be a descendant, not a sibling class on the same element.\n\nSplit into a parent .virtualAssistant wrapper div and a child\n.va-embed div, matching the working pattern in AstroVirtualAssistant.\nThis allows the prompt-suggestions flex-direction: column override\nto correctly apply and prevent horizontal scrolling.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57038b4ea1188fe1f2e7625b506afc9c2c8f6251","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/git/trees/57038b4ea1188fe1f2e7625b506afc9c2c8f6251"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/git/commits/a69201c9ecaddd7f8ba732ccf047f2d99dde61df","verification":{"payload":"tree 57038b4ea1188fe1f2e7625b506afc9c2c8f6251\nparent 0ddeb8649afe656842b4f3f3acc12cceb34f8f8f\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1779801052 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779801052 -0400\n\nfix(va-embed): separate virtualAssistant wrapper from va-embed div (#384)\n\nRHCLOUD-47504\n\nThe sassPrefix build config wraps all SCSS selectors as descendants\nof .virtualAssistant. When both .virtualAssistant and .va-embed were\non the same DOM element, the compiled CSS selector\n.virtualAssistant .va-embed never matched because it requires\n.va-embed to be a descendant, not a sibling class on the same element.\n\nSplit into a parent .virtualAssistant wrapper div and a child\n.va-embed div, matching the working pattern in AstroVirtualAssistant.\nThis allows the prompt-suggestions flex-direction: column override\nto correctly apply and prevent horizontal scrolling.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFZvcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKJcQAJmNAeavJ0S7YE5/1bxk/rdv\nav8F0upO8eTLuBB27RNevTnnPIrH7S4KfOYYs7AJnlY2SP2roLeeQrSlzJfWQ0dj\n7u92eytsL5NfZ9aMU+Q4EXnP5CXWColj5TdyvaYVAWBBlIcn3eYIXlGrh9T4FVV4\nl8PgwTODZsCWAmb3ukeNoIGUlBdGOHpvj8uK4M1sTZ3k82RXSf/qT9BKuMxSm0Q7\ndmwcip1FQSXIePcclTpTxI9kFNh5R8Ffsb9RAHOoftGsZQO65sQhCn3pPaLPr1RX\nNERHkl5IhEPte