:"https://api.github.com/users/red-hat-konflux%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-hat-konflux%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-hat-konflux%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-hat-konflux%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-hat-konflux%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red-hat-konflux%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/commits/2dee9c6bbcc95595e8d04f4176ace61775f3b4f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-22T20:30:21Z","email":"126015336+red-hat-konflux[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"red-hat-konflux[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-22T20:30:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): update build-tools digest to 9026daa (#353)\n\n* chore(deps): update build-tools digest to 9026daa\n\nSigned-off-by: red-hat-konflux <126015336+red-hat-konflux[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix race condition in CREATE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT failure test\n\nThe test was failing due to a race condition where cy.wait() completed\nbefore the async error handling finished. Updated to use cy.wrap().should()\nwhich will retry until the assertion passes, properly waiting for the\nerror handling to complete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: red-hat-konflux <126015336+red-hat-konflux[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: red-hat-konflux[bot] <126015336+red-hat-konflux[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: tahmidefaz <tahmidefaz@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"10bfcff6577c714dadc05e90d777f8e67cb9869f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/astro-virtual-assistant-frontend/git/trees/10bfcff