s","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parsakhosravani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parsakhosravani/parsa/commits/4b6eb0a88664eb383224c03df5c2612a02e25fac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T06:31:07Z","email":"parsakhosravani@gmail.com","name":"parsakhosravani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T06:31:07Z","email":"parsakhosravani@gmail.com","name":"parsakhosravani"},"message":"Refactor Tailwind and PostCSS configurations, update TypeScript target, and implement Angular, Vue, and React story components\n\n- Simplified PostCSS configuration by removing unused plugins.\n- Updated Tailwind configuration to include only necessary content and plugins.\n- Changed TypeScript target from ES5 to ES2017 and added experimental decorators.\n- Created Angular story component with dynamic loading and bootstrapping.\n- Added Vue story component with dynamic loading and template rendering.\n- Implemented React story page with state management for chapter navigation.\n- Introduced story navigation component for consistent navigation across frameworks.\n- Defined story chapters and framework data in a new lib module.\n- Added zone.js and Vue type declarations for compatibility.","tree":{"sha":"1382ffdf586a81f9ddeabeb12137e72e90318cf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parsakhosravani/parsa/git/trees/1382ffdf586a81f9ddeabeb12137e72e90318cf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parsakhosravani/parsa/git/commits/4b6eb0a88664eb383224c03df5c2612a02e25fac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72360929?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parsakhosravani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parsakhosravani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parsakhosravani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gith