17T14:08:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"revert(shell): revert visualViewport keyboard fix — made it worse (#16)\n\nrevert(shell): revert visualViewport keyboard fix — made it worse\n\nReverts the --app-height/visualViewport keyboard-shrink logic from #15.\nConfirmed worse on a real iPhone: it competed with Safari''s own native\nscroll-into-view behavior instead of replacing it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014sHGyzm5pMe4BUGG7CZkiN","tree":{"sha":"322cee4383f1f0628595f984aad3cb7a75c4361b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/git/trees/322cee4383f1f0628595f984aad3cb7a75c4361b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/git/commits/fb1113803761500567a31036a7db773db3232e29","verification":{"payload":"tree 322cee4383f1f0628595f984aad3cb7a75c4361b\nparent a28a28ae35f880f029cf26566fcb738dadfe33fb\nauthor Ian Gabriel Oliveira de Sousa <22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com> 1789654107 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789654107 -0300\n\nrevert(shell): revert visualViewport keyboard fix — made it worse (#16)\n\nrevert(shell): revert visualViewport keyboard fix — made it worse\n\nReverts the --app-height/visualViewport keyboard-shrink logic from #15.\nConfirmed worse on a real iPhone: it competed with Safari''s own native\nscroll-into-view behavior instead of replacing it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014sHGyzm5pMe4BUGG7CZkiN","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq/RbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQc8QADDfGLa9GP1HjWhKWFrkdgsH\ne0h1EakiVV6qMdT+7GUDW6Swzl0TrB5VTYSha82cd3ATepjw8bLx8yoDBqGpBha8\nyerp7Ast2v5fLIAsjMC/b2WaHjGPN0TBERgX1/JPwBuXg7kIE+pjeRtLxCotMN05\nlbGayn8D3HpVaRE1xYK01lnHQBwywhGBzA3SAogQVlpPMYEznRAaTz15e/IS+b/m\nKJWIWxzn1aa0k6aDnqZcG5xelhXtog+RUS/50WEPsNM3/cvNDjP7VvYdHo9Jg0Pz\nvLE3d7JQiVDgJrrTRqpV4X1pZpJrqENTE5nlliLk