now inherits height: 100% instead of re-querying the viewport via\n100dvh, and html/body get overflow: hidden + overscroll-behavior: none so\nthe document itself can never scroll or bounce, exposing the dark ground\nbehind the fixed header/bottom bar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014sHGyzm5pMe4BUGG7CZkiN","tree":{"sha":"13c5bcd3551188a090e200383495ce0fae8628ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/git/trees/13c5bcd3551188a090e200383495ce0fae8628ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/git/commits/20de02c5f8f540ebe6859ba5c3ac727c81984209","verification":{"payload":"tree 13c5bcd3551188a090e200383495ce0fae8628ab\nparent 59dc14b84f6602205ae2171d00c09e25ed0a289b\nauthor Ian Gabriel Oliveira de Sousa <22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com> 1789632870 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789632870 -0300\n\nfix(shell): stop the document from scrolling/bouncing on mobile (#13)\n\nfix(shell): stop the document from scrolling/bouncing on mobile\n\nShell now inherits height: 100% instead of re-querying the viewport via\n100dvh, and html/body get overflow: hidden + overscroll-behavior: none so\nthe document itself can never scroll or bounce, exposing the dark ground\nbehind the fixed header/bottom bar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014sHGyzm5pMe4BUGG7CZkiN","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq6FmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwmYQAJkYo5WX3tlprLrK2PIqJTz6\nCUSSEVSPpPio+hIprKnHxpWNIhDlyQCQwC47fRnQqevvRV3CX/E6iu43/3gB+P3R\neBP5kazOWFuJJ5ITWleJGzrkN0XA1MbZVG/9noT7z7YkE7IxnUavXSlyJtsVBosH\nsoNsiEWiozVw8jg8OLJACIDkffVzTYIrSEu0snn0y84/iz3ZIhHL7dSR0qG04W/C\nitPXpxbDiCx4og/PDW1dTnDkbxC35LQtv1ROnR0Ac2iDHZVfCJZEOUv2jGHTbChG\ny/qJ+vLCE+U0FeD4NYEusdS8rT9o3YIh67lDVV7NeS4FDBZmUzpomAKBMGmqVep5\nzquDlKmxf7h8oMl0wEUEioxfBu3b6zux/TDNSUXDdEYGqJ/X1my3SHBWBxZ0pJPK\nVktxkm09eeF