Oliv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/commits/375cd3848fc2a34b3a693d0cc238c117421536be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:40:48Z","email":"22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ian Gabriel Oliveira de Sousa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:40:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(nav): extend bottom bar tint through the iOS safe area (#11)\n\nfix(nav): extend bottom bar tint through the iOS safe area\n\nMoves the safe-area-inset-bottom padding from the bar surface onto each\nitem, so the item''s background (including the active tab''s tint) stretches\nto fill the whole bar and reaches the true screen edge, instead of stopping\nat the 64px content height and leaving an untinted gap above the home\nindicator on notched iPhones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014sHGyzm5pMe4BUGG7CZkiN","tree":{"sha":"3ce0a8186fb0a4815292cc6b902509d2cef6c17b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/git/trees/3ce0a8186fb0a4815292cc6b902509d2cef6c17b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/git/commits/375cd3848fc2a34b3a693d0cc238c117421536be","verification":{"payload":"tree 3ce0a8186fb0a4815292cc6b902509d2cef6c17b\nparent dba4bc842a5ef8bbca109e2b18eaf43efd6635e4\nauthor Ian Gabriel Oliveira de Sousa <22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com> 1789630848 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789630848 -0300\n\nfix(nav): extend bottom bar tint through the iOS safe area (#11)\n\nfix(nav): extend bottom bar tint through the iOS safe area\n\nMoves the safe-area-inset-bottom padding from the bar surface onto each\nitem, so the item''s background (including the active tab''s tint) stretches\nto fill the whole bar and reaches the true screen edge, instead of stopping\nat the 64px content height and leaving an untinted gap above the home\nindicator on notched iPhones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014sHGyzm5pMe4BUGG7CZkiN","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq5mACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUlQQAAEneyELRwfoYro9CDzxLa1O\nMIot1Bx5UnM/BR9/gZUwO8gDoDYy/2A/nvnktHklENqrguiqI1P85LkCNJDYqM52\n0RUInL7xJjGrYjKATZyhYerPp+K3huLWpxu4kbsE210xJfmgY0CeGGjxzsZwhOMl\nQZdnVtqe3Vqx+k0RAvCcM5n4FzQBEUMy6nYMoWHVJIGuCBE1hVV65tnXFM192DvG\na74Aaq2BUONeX5t1wtfPMx6pps5DhOZdVxWoA+rx75SeP69p03vDUkYMedqNdR+g\nAG+FAWvpi6gXyVq+tftwqDyGs9QbGeiYVHWcXseQadkeqeyUrEiEQf7qAhPmH/+j\nna0Heow3Z5JVYkh42OkHOSDkjTbnsJscxm2QkPan/a+7iszfAiPs0FkhcF80WD+X\nSzNWvUozwe9/r/6vA2RhQ47dlsb14KzmGkyrwMlKic9Vl+Z3KjVxT8Z7qjhX74zd\n1asWWTrRiRqkdJLwIjtuM9e1MgM6PdcqdXiowEMXP819nY+CNHy6kye1ZMduV3hP\nktezDPWjkIJeOzkE06AGIzt/QGz7E6Zu3sdLWoKlxgOLXpfHuQxpTjvmAcJtZyWy\nObTTJYhlXr53zO9r6wWAYZgrQbXF6x/FYVIslynGMfXuiliDkfzVqnbcDJtwt1Lz\nfJs8DXZYkcbOu5So7Pia\n=B2Dk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T07:40:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IanOliv/wrapper/commit/375cd3848fc2a34b3a693d0cc238c117421536be","node_id":"C_kwDOKB7Fj9oAKDM3NWNkMzg0OGZjMmEzNGIzYTY5M2QwY2MyMzhjMTE3NDIxNTM2YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IanOliv/wrapper/commit/dba4bc842a5ef8bbca109e2b18eaf43efd6635e4","sha":"dba4bc842a5ef8bbca109e2b18eaf43efd6635e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/commits/dba4bc842a5ef8bbca109e2b18eaf43efd6635e4"}],"sha":"375cd3848fc2a34b3a693d0cc238c117421536be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/commits/375cd3848fc2a34b3a693d0cc238c117421536be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22185362?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IanOliv","id":22185362,"login":"IanOliv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTg1MzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/commits/dba4bc842a5ef8bbca109e2b18eaf43efd6635e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:14:42Z","email":"22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ian Gabriel Oliveira de Sousa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:14:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deploy): add SPA rewrite for Vercel (#10)\n\nfix(deploy): add SPA rewrite for Vercel\n\nEvery non-root route (including the manifest''s start_url, /card) was\nreturning a raw 404 from Vercel because nothing told it to fall back to\nindex.html for client-side routes. This is what broke opening the\ninstalled PWA on iOS — start_url does a fresh navigation straight to\n/card, which had no server-side fallback and hit the 404.\n\nVerified on the PR preview: /card and /ARfiti now return 200, static\nassets (manifest.webmanifest, favicon.ico) still served directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014sHGyzm5pMe4BUGG7CZkiN","tree":{"sha":"760e9d13d5092f5c2cb07121b916b32f4de8df57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/git/trees/760e9d13d5092f5c2cb07121b916b32f4de8df57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/git/commits/dba4bc842a5ef8bbca109e2b18eaf43efd6635e4","verification":{"payload":"tree 760e9d13d5092f5c2cb07121b916b32f4de8df57\nparent 117533546466bd595d6c8184161318f709bf2222\nauthor Ian Gabriel Oliveira de Sousa <22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com> 1789629282 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789629282 -0300\n\nfix(deploy): add SPA rewrite for Vercel (#10)\n\nfix(deploy): add SPA rewrite for Vercel\n\nEvery non-root route (including the manifest''s start_url, /card) was\nreturning a raw 404 from Vercel because nothing told it to fall back to\nindex.html for client-side routes. This is what broke opening the\ninstalled PWA on iOS — start_url does a fresh navigation straight to\n/card, which had no server-side fallback and hit the 404.\n\nVerified on the PR preview: /card and /ARfiti now return 200, static\nassets (manifest.webmanifest, favicon.ico) still served directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014sHGyzm5pMe4BUGG7CZkiN","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQ