.com/users/IanOliv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/commits/ebb59cbca4bce987d3ecf757505b63fc26f22ef1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:23:33Z","email":"22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ian Gabriel Oliveira de Sousa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:23:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(deckboard): add DeckBoardSession card-battle board component (#8)\n\nPorts the DeckBoardSession design handoff (design_handoff_deckboard/) into\na production component: HUD, draw/discard rail, 5x6 board with an enemy\nzone and a player zone, fanned hand, side panel (preview/shortcuts/log),\nand a debug drawer for tuning scale/reach/timing live.\n\nState is a single reducer (cards/enemies/turn/energy/log/undo), and both\nthe zone-change FLIP and the attack lunge are real DOM measurements/WAAPI\nanimations rather than declarative CSS transitions, matching the handoff''s\nanimation model. Mounted at /deck-board-session (Labs, experimental) so it\ncan be reached and tested.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3926ec61594649e209acaf04aad04fcaa109f90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/git/trees/a3926ec61594649e209acaf04aad04fcaa109f90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IanOliv/wrapper/git/commits/ebb59cbca4bce987d3ecf757505b63fc26f22ef1","verification":{"payload":"tree a3926ec61594649e209acaf04aad04fcaa109f90\nparent 76600946be63934a4e1638ca40701d9a19882faa\nauthor Ian Gabriel Oliveira de Sousa <22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com> 1789626213 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789626213 -0300\n\nfeat(deckboard): add DeckBoardSession card-battle board component (#8)\n\nPorts the DeckBoardSession design handoff (design_handoff_deckboard/) into\na production component: HUD, draw/discard rail, 5x6 board with an enemy\nzone and a player zone, fanned hand, side panel (preview/shortcuts/log),\nand a debug drawer for tuning scale/reach/timing live.\n\nState is a single reducer (cards/enemies/turn/energy/log/undo), and both\nthe zone-change FLIP and the attack lunge are real DOM measurements/WAAPI\nanimations rather than declarative CSS transitions, matching the handoff''s\nanimation model. Mounted at /deck-board-session (Labs, experimental) so it\ncan be reached and tested.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq4dlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnYgQAHheWmo4tKej8i0Vfm2JRils\nqBiFYgZYtqmxM97q+wAsbWQQI7qCdSq2jC/k3QCwZn8N21JBnF97wNPwKTpyVSyH\nLdbLT+RxENw7NQxSDKWgsYNGEdUgA6Hcr23f3JMLLh4gcaBbZJ/wxz1rPmY21OR3\n1VhywriAi+Ww9A67dkmXMhjI94XD29cYu4qOlODunHc9I1+tmm+h/DkUkcdcyaXS\nK5TpJOyojz1k+gzuSPtSaFCo1Zqk+YDvKX6fXOxDev1L4UROKpvc7bJxCzePM9+8\n68QX0+zo5z90ZNI8dPiyc8SJFm6izR41Bacn1zb/JKi3FkrFkArTPnqGVQVH2cku\ngRlk2xulwNgk3Mw5+ve9pDSL4u5Buhz5pNwf7QYYU6gJI6tnQl20d7YHrme86p3m\nfpsXKCTTjQdkFt4ZCrTc58kCI8bYZOalTP++YvIRPE254NoaoV7PYMZWFlj6C0KS\nJC0/hhgJEKSKNs6J0Dxu2evZF9lEzNG6haSs7D45zmoZeSw7lwSlEuvwg+dFYzjb\nyOri0w+KMG84ahQGM+XitNygWRKS7eQMuVDi9ixFuw3VAlsazKxhUz+/SdgfvWNA\nIEawolZJrnsDm9eL1HwlGhxynjEubG4yN3q3+VcTmbSXdxv5lXJ2nEGVsTyQiyym\nlSeT4AvM872rglMxTr9d\n=X759\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T06:23:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-